<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">LUNGOLKOP</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Lungolkop</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lungolkop</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lung</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUNGOLKOP</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Buk pa Lungolkop tye ki ododo pa jo Icrael, cake ikare ma onongo loc ma atir peke i lobogi, nio kwede wa ikare ma gucako bedo ite loc me ker meggi. Lok me ododo magi tito pi yweka pa oteka lwenygi ma gutiyo matek pi lobogi ma gin onongo lutela meggi ma kilwongogi ni “lungolkop.” Polgi con gubedo luwimony ma pe gin obedo macalo lungolkop me kare ducu ma nongo gin tiyo ki cik me lobo me tiro jo ma mito ngak woko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngat acel ki ikin gi ma jo ducu gingeyo obedo Samson, ma tice ma en otiyo kicoyo i buk man cake i cura me apar wiye adeke nio kwede wa i cura me apar wiye abicele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pwony madit ma wanongo ki i buk man en aye ni kwo maber pa Luicrael tye ma okeme ki gin me bedo luwiny lok pa Lubanga, ento kwero bedo luwiny Rwot pole okelo botgi can ki peko madongo. Lubanga kare ducu tye atera me laro jone ka gin ongut dok guloke gudwogo cen bote.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Gin ma obedo katime nio kwede wa ikare ma Yocwa oto iye <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 1:1-2:10">1:1—2:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lungolkop ma guloyo lobo Icrael <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 2:11-16:31">2:11—16:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jami mogo ma obedo katime i kwogi ki ikare meno <char style="ior"><ref loc="JDG 17:1-21:25">17:1—21:25</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s1">Jo Juda ki jo Cimeon gumako Adoni-bejek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Ka Yocwa dong oto, jo Icrael gucako penyo dog Rwot ni, “Anga ma bikwongo cito pirwa kalweny ikom jo Kanaan?” <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />Ci Rwot ogamo ni, “Jo Juda aye gibicito, pien dong atyeko miyo lobo man ducu i cinggi.” <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Jo Juda dok guwaco bot omegigi jo Cimeon ni. “Wubin wunywak kwedwa wot i lobo ma kipoko botwa ki kwiri, wek walweny ikom jo Kanaan. Ka wanongo kabedo me yweyowa, ci wan bene wabinywako kwedwu i wot wu me cito kitmeno i lobo ma ki poko botwu wek wun bene onong kabedowu.” Ma omiyo jo Cimeon guteno kwot kwedgi. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Ka jo Juda guoto mony ikomgi, Rwot omiyo jo Kanaan ki jo Periji i cinggi, ci guloyo dano alip apar i Bejek. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />I lweny meno jo Juda gurwate ki Adoni-bejek laloc madit me Bejek igange kunu, ka gulwenyo ikome ci gutaye woko omiyo guloyo jo Kanaan ki jo Periji malit. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Ento ikare meno ka Adoni-bejek onongo ni lwenye odoko teke en oringo woko, ento gulubu kore, ci gumake, ka gungolo twoni cinge woko, ki twoni tyene. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Ka man dong otime Adoni-bejek owaco lok man ni, “Yam luker pyere abiro ma kingolo twoni cinggi ki twoni tyen gi gubedo kacoko ngide cam ite mejana; kit mayam atimo ikomgini, Lubanga dong ocula kitmeno.” Ci kitere i Jerucalem, kama en oto ki iye.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Juda guloyo Jerucalem ki Kebron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Ka jo Juda dok gulwenyo ikom Jerucalem ci gumako woko. Jo Juda guneko jo matye iye ki pala lucwan, ka dok guwango taun madit meno woko ki mac. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Ka lacen jo Juda dok gucito kalweny ikom jo Kanaan ma gibedo i lobo godi, ki i Negeb, ki i pwor got. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Jo Juda gucito bene kalweny ikom jo Kanaan ma gibedo i Kebron, ci guloyo Cecai, Akiman ki Talmai. Taun madit ma kilwongo ni Kebron, yam nyinge obedo Kiriat-arba.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otiniel omayo taun me Debir ci kimiye Akaca obed dakone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 15:15-19">Yoc 15:15-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Ka gua ki kunu, gucito kalweny ikom jo ma gibedo i Debir. Nying Debir yam obedo Kiriat-ceper. <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Ci Kaleb owaco ni. “Ka ngat mo olwenyo ikom Kiriat-ceper ce omako, ci abimiye nyara Akaca wek obed dakone.” <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Otiniel wod pa Kenaj, ma omin Kaleb matidine, aye omako, ci Kaleb omiye nyare Akaca obedo dakone. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Ka nyako ocito bot cware inino me nyome, ci cware odiye ki lok ni openy poto mo bot wone. Akaca ocito bot wone ci opye piny ki iwi kanane ci Kaleb openye ni, “Imito gin ango?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Nyare ogamo doge ni, “Miya mot mo do; macalo dong iketa wa i lobo Negeb, koni dok imiya wang it mo bene.” Kaleb omiye wang it matye ki malo ki wang it matye piny i kor got bene.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kabedo ma jo Juda ki Benjamin gumayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Likwayo pa jo Keni, ma jo paoc Moses, gucito kacel ki jo Juda kun gia ki i taun madit me Otit, gucito wa i tim me lobo Juda matye i Negeb macok ki Arad; ci gucito gubedo kacel ki jo Amalek. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Jo Juda gucito ilweny kacel ki omegigi jo Cimeon, ci guloyo jo Kanaan ma gibedo i Jepat. Ci gudyero taun madit meno woko i cing Rwot, ka dok gujwero woko; ma omiyo nying taun madit meno gulwongo ni Korma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="fk">Korma </char> te loke “Dyero me aneka.”</note>. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Juda dok omako Gaja ki lobo ma ingete, Acikelon ki lobo ma ingete ki Ekron ki lobo ma ingete. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />Rwot obedo ki kica ikom Juda, ma omiyo en otyeko camo lobo godi odoko mere; ento ryemo jo ma gibedo i bar oloye, pien onongo gitye ki gadigadi lweny me nyonyo. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Kebron kimiyo bot Kaleb, kit mayam Moses ocikoni; ci en oryemo likwayo pa Anak adek woko ki kunu. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Yoc 15:63</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:6">2 Cam 5:6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 11:4">1 Tek 11:4</ref></char></note>Ento jo Benjamin pe guryemo jo Jebuc ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ma omiyo jo Jebuc gunywako kabedo i Jerucalem kacel ki jo Benjamin nio kwede wa onyo.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Likwayo pa Yucepu gumayo Betel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Jo me ot pa Yucepu bene gucito kalweny ikom Betel, ci Rwot obedo kwedgi. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Ci gin gucwalo lurotpiny i Betel, meno aye taun madit mayam kilwongo ni Luj. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Ka lurotpiny guneno dano mo matye kabino kun oa ki i taun madit meno, ci guwaco bote ni, “Nyut botwa yoo me donyo i taun madit man ba, ci wabitimi maber.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Ka dong en onyutu botgi yoo me donyo i taun madit meno, ci nen gin guneko dano ducu ma gitye iye ki pala lucwan; ento guweko laco meno ki ludogolane gucito makwo. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Dano meno ocito i lobo pa jo Kit, ci ogero iye taun madit meno, ci ocako nyinge ni Luj; meno aye obedo nyinge nio kwede wa onyo.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kabedo ma jo Manace ki jo Epraim gumayo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 17:11-13">Yoc 17:11-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo Manace pe guryemo jo ma gibedo i Bet-cean ki i taun gi matino ma ingete, kadi jo ma gibedo i Taanak, Dor, Ibleam ki Megiddo ki i taun matino ma ingetgi; ento jo Kanaan gucere ci gubedo i lobonu. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Ka jo Icrael gudoko tek, ci gudiyo jo Kanaan ki tic muroni, ento pe guryemogi woko ducu.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 16:10">Yoc 16:10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jo Epraim pe guryemo jo Kanaan ma gubedo i Gejer, ento jo Kanaan gubedo ikin gi i Gejer.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kabedo ma kaka mukene gutero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Jo Jabulon pe guryemo jo ma gibedo i Kitron, kadi jo ma gibedo i Nakalol; ento jo Kanaan gubedo ikin gi, ci guketogi i tic muroni.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Jo Acer pe guryemo jo ma gibedo i Akko, kadi jo ma gubedo i Cidon, Aklab, Akijib, Kelba, Apik ki Rekob. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Ento jo Acer gubedo ikin jo Kanaan ma gin wegi lobonu, pien pe guryemogi woko.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Jo Naputali pe guryemo jo ma gibedo i Bet-cemec ki Bet-anat, ento gubedo ikin jo Kanaan ma gin wegi lobonu. Kadi bed kumeno, guketo jo Bet-cemec ki Bet-anat i tic muroni.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Jo Amor gudiyo jo Dan, gudwokogi wa i lobo godi, pe guye ni gucit i bar. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Jo Amor gucere gubedo i got Kerec, i Aijalon ki i Calabim. Ento jo ma i ot pa Yucepu gudiyogi matek, ka dong guketogi bene i tic muroni. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Wang lobo pa jo Amor ocake kama kiito ki iye malo ki i Akrabim, wok ki i Cela ci cito ito kwede wa malo i godi.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s1">Lok pa lamalaika pa Rwot i Bokim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />Lamalaika pa Rwot oa ki i Gilgal ocito i Bokim, ci owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Yam akwanyowu ki i Ejipt, ci akelowu wa i lobo mayam akwongo pire ni abimiyo bot kwariwu. Ci yam bene awaco ki wun ni, ‘Pe abituru gicikena kwedwu matwal, <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:12-13">Nia 34:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:2-5">Nwo 7:2-5</ref></char></note>wun bene pe wuket gicike mo ikinwu ki jo ma gibedo i lobo man. Ki wubimuku keno tyer pa jogigi woko.’ Ento wun pe wulubu cika ma amiyo botwu nio wa tin, wun dong wutimo nge loka keken do! <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Kombedi dong awaco botwu kuman ni, pe dong abiryemogi woko ki inyimwu; gibidoko lumonewu, ki lubangagi bibedo owic me makowu.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />Ka lamalaika pa Rwot oloko lok meno bot jo Icrael ducu, ci jo Icrael guwoo ki koko. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Gucako nying kabedonu ni Bokim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="fk">Bokim </char> te loke ni jo ma kumu.</note> ci gutumu gitum bot Rwot kunu.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Yocwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOS 24:29-31">Yoc 24:29-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Ka Yocwa dong olwongo lwak me cikogi ci gin ducu guket woko kun ngat acel acel cito i lobo me gin aleyane kacamone. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Jo Icrael gutiyo bot Rwot ikare me kwo pa Yocwa ducu ki ikare pa ludongo ducu mayam gudong ka Yocwa dong oto, gin aye jo ma guneno tic madito ducu mayam Rwot otiyo pi jone Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Yocwa wod pa Nun ma en latic pa Rwot oto woko ma mwaka me dite onongo oromo miya acel ki apar. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:49-50">Yoc 19:49-50</ref></char></note>Guyike ikom dul lobone kikome, i ginaleyane mayam kimiyo bote i Timnat-kerec i lobo godi pa jo Epraim ki tung kumalo me got Gaac. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Ci yalwak meno ducu guto woko gudok bot kwarigi, yalwak mukene ma olubugi onongo pe gingeyo Rwot, kadi wa tic mayam Rwot otiyo pi jo Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Icrael guweko woro Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Ka jo Icrael gucako tiyo gin manen marac iwang Rwot pi woro jogi ma nyinggi Baal. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Gubwoto lubu kor Rwot Lubanga pa kwarogi woko, mayam okwanyogi ki i lobo Ejipt, ci gucako lubu kor lubanga mogo mukene ki ikin lwak lubanga pa rok mapatpat ma orumugi dyereni; ci guryebe wa inyimgi bene, man omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubangagi matek. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Gubwoto Rwot Lubanga woko, ka gucako woro jogi Baal mapati ki jogi ma mon gu. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Pieno kiniga omako Rwot Lubanga ikom jo Icrael ci omiyogi woko i cing luyak jamigi, ma gubedo kayako jamigi. Dok omiyogi woko ite twero pa lumerokgi ma orumugi dyere, omiyo pe dong gitye ki kero mo me cung inyim lumerokgi. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Ka gin gucito kalweny ikare meno, ci Rwot obedo kakelo can ikomgi, kun lubu kit ma Rwot onongo okwongo kwonge botgi; ci piny orem kwedgi woko.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tic pa lungolkop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Lacen Rwot obedo kamiyo bot jo Icrael kare ki kare lungolkop ma gin oita lweny wek gulargi woko ki ite twero pa jo mayam ounugi kunu bene dok giyako jamigini. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Ento kadi bed kumeno jo Icrael pe guworo dog lungolkopgi; gubedo kaworo lubanga mogogu kun gimede ki ryebewa inyimgi. Guloke dok gubare woko oyot ki i yo mayam kwarogi gulubu. Kwarogi onongo yam gulubu Cik pa Rwot, ento gin pe gulubu cike. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />Ikare ducu ma Rwot omiyo botgi Langolkop mo, ci Rwot bedo ki langolkop meno; ci Rwot obedo kalarogi ki i cing lumerokgi pi kare pa Langolkop meno ducu. Kica yam mako Rwot ikomgi kare ki kare ka gicur ikom jo ma unugi kun bene gidiyogi ki tek. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Ento ka langolkop meno oto woko, ci gitare, gidok woko cen katimo tim maracu makato kwarigi ducu, kun gilubu kor lubanga mogogu mukene, dok giworogi ma giryebe bene piny inyimgi; pe gibwoto timgi mo, kadi wa kit ducu ma gibedo kalubu pi nwang ngutgini. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael, ci owaco ni, “Jo man guturu gicikena mayam acike kwede ki kwarigi, dok gukwero wa woro doga. <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />Pimeno pe dong abiryemo rok mo woko ki inyimgi ma ikin lwak rok mapatpat mayam Yocwa oto owekogini, <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />wek dong atem ki cwiny jo Icrael, anen ka gibigwoke kun gilubu yo pa Rwot macalo kwarigi yam gugwoke iye, nyo pe.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Kitmeno Rwot dong oweko rok meno ducu gubedo, pe dok oryemogi woko ducu lawangacel, kun onongo ceng en pe omiyogi ite twero pa Yocwa.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="s1">Rok ma gudong pi temo jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Magi aye rok ma Rwot oweko gudong i lobo me temo kwede cwiny jo Icrael, makato ducu jo ma i Icrael ma peya gulwenyo lweny mo keken ki i Kanaan. <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />En owekogi pi lok man keken wek yalwak ma i Icrael ducu gunyebe ki lweny; wek en opwonygi ki lweny, makato ducu jo ma yam pe gungiyo kwede. <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Magi en aye rok ma Rwot Lubanga oweko gudong i lobo me ginaleya pa jo Icrael. Jo Piliciti ki rwodigi abic, jo Kanaan ducu, jo Cidon ki jo Kiv mayam gibedo i godi me Lebanon, cake ki i got Baal-kermon o kwede wa i yoo ma donyo i Kamat. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Gin aye gubedo me temo cwiny Luicrael pi ngeyo ka gibilubu Cik pa Rwot ducu mayam en ociko bot kwarigi ki i dog Moses. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gubedo i dye jo Kanaan, jo Kit, jo Amor, jo Periji, jo Kiv ki jo Jebuc. <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Ci gucako nyomo anyiragi, ka dok gin bene gumiyo anyiragi bot awobegi wek gunyom; ci gin gucako woro lwak lubangagini.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Otiniel olaro jo Icrael ki i cing Kucan-ricataim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Jo Icrael gutimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, kun wigi bene owil woko ikom Rwot Lubangagi, ci guworo jogi Baal ki Aciterotgu. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Pieno omiyo kiniga omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael, ci omiyogi woko i cing Kucan-ricataim laloc me Mecopotamia. Jo Icrael gutiyo bot Kucan-ricataim mwaka aboro. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Ento ka jo Icrael gukok bot Rwot, en omiyogi dano mo ma olarogi, en aye Otiniel wod pa Kenaj, ma omin Kaleb matidine. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />Cwiny pa Rwot obino ikome, ci obedo kangolo kop i Icrael. Ka en ocito kalweny, Rwot omiyo Kucan-ricataim laloc me Mecopotamia i cinge, ci en obwoyo Kucan-ricataim woko. <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Kitmeno omiyo lobo Icrael oywe pi mwaka pyere angwen, ci lacen Otiniel wod pa Kenaj oto.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekud olaro jo Icrael ki i cing jo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Jo Icrael dok gutimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, ci Rwot omiyo tek bot Eglon laloc me Moab wek olweny ikom jo Icrael, pien onongo gutiyo gin manen maracu iwang Rwot. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Eglon ocoko jo Ammon ki jo Amalek, ci ocito kwedgi kalweny wek gilo jo Icrael, ci gin gumayo Jeriko taun madit ma kilwongo taun madit me otit woko. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Jo Icrael gutiyo bot Eglon laloc me Moab pi mwaka apar wiye aboro kulu.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Ento ka jo Icrael gukok bot Rwot, en omiyogi dano ma olarogi, en aye Ekud wod pa Gera ma jo Benjamin, dano ma lacam. Jo Icrael gumiyo en aye otero mucorogi bot Eglon laloc me Moab. <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Ekud oteto pala lucwane ma lake bit ryoryo ma bore romo puti acel ki nucu, ci orwako ite bongone, otweyo ikom eme tung lacuc, <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />ocito otero mucoro bot Eglon. Eglon onongo obedo dano ma ocwe mada. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ka Ekud otyeko miyo mot me mucoro bot laloc meno, ci en ogonyo dano ma gutingo mot magi me cako wot me dok cen tugi. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Ento en kikome, ka oo i godi ma kipayo apaya macok ki Gilgal, ocuku cwiny jo ma en owoto kwedgi me wot cito anyim. Ento en mere oloke odok cen bot laloc me Moab ka owace ni, “Atye ki lok mo me mung ma kicwala kwede boti, ladit.” Ka laloci ocako ciko jone ni, “Wuling kong ka dok owaco ni gukat woko!” Ci lwak lutice ducu ma gucung inyime gukato woko. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Ka Ekud obino bote, onongo en obedo kene i kicikane mangic matye malo iwi ot. Ci Ekud owaco ni, “Atye ki kwena ma oa ki bot Lubanga ma akelo boti,” ci laloci oa malo ki iwi kome. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Ekud oroyo cinge ma lacam, ka omako pala lucwane, ma owoto ki i eme tung lacuc, ocobo ki i ladit laloci. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Lak pala odonyo wa ki bole libuc i iye, ci moo iye opuyu lak pala woko. Pe dok owoto pala lucwan woko ki i i ladit laloc meno, ci wee iye okati woko. <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Ekud okato woko ki kama kidonyo kwede i otti, ci oloro dogola me kicika me wi ot kama ladit laloci tye iyeni, ka otweyo woko.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Ka Ekud dong ocito woko, ci lutice gubino. Ka guneno ni dogola me kicika ma iwi ot dong kitweyo woko, ci gubedo katamo ni, “Laditwa tye kakonye i ot matidi ma i kicika mangici.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Gubedo kakurune nio ka doggi otwo woko; ento ka en pud orii kun pe oyabo dogola me kicika me wi ot, gukwanyo layab, guyabo kwede, ci nen, rwotgi obutu i dye ot ma dong oto.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Ma pud gigale, Ekud olwi oringo woko, okato wa inge godi ma kipayo apaya ca, en oringo olaro Ceira. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Ka dong oo kunu, okutu tum i lobo godi me Epraim pi oto mony me Icrael pi lweny; ci gucito kwede gua ki i lobo godi, kun en aye telo wigi. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Owaco botgi ni, “Wulub kora, pien Rwot dong otyeko miyo lumerokwu, jo Moab, i cingwu.” Gucito kwede, gumako wang wat me Jordan me gengo jo Moab; pe guye dano acel mo ongolo kulu. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Ikare meno guneko jo Moab macok romo alip apar, ma gin ducu twoni co matego; acel mo pe obwot. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Kitmeno gutayo jo Moab woko inino meno. Gubedo ite loc pa jo Icrael ci lobogi oywe pi mwaka pyere aboro.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Camgar olaro jo Icrael ki i cing jo Piliciti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Ngat ma olubu kor Ekud obedo Camgar wod pa Anat ma oneko jo Piliciti miya abicel ki dim lalek dyang; en bene olaro jo Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s1">Debora ki Barak guloyo Cicera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ka Ekud dong oto woko, jo Icrael dok gutimo gin ma marac inyim Rwot. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Man oweko Rwot omiyogi dok i cing Jabin laloc mo pa jo Kanaan mayam obedo kaloc i Kajor. Lawimonye nyinge Cicera, ma en bedo ki i Karocet-ka-goyim. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Jo Icrael dok gukok bot Rwot ni okonygi, pien Jabin onongo obedo laloc magwa ikomgi kun en ounu jo Icrael matek pi mwaka pyere aryo kulu. En ceng tye ki gadigadi lweny me nyonyo miya abongwen.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Ikare meno Debora, lanebi ma dako ma cware Lapidot, aye obedo langolkop pa jo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />En nongo bedo ite otit pa Debora, matye ikin Rama ki Betel ma i lobo godi me Epraim, ci jo Icrael gibino bote wek en ongol ki gin kop. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Inino mo acel Debora ocwalo kwena me lwongo bot Barak wod pa Abinoam ki i Kedec i lobo pa jo Naputali, kun waco bote ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael ociko in ni, ‘Cit i cok joni iwi got Tabor kun ikwanyo jo alip apar ki i kaka pa Naputali ki kaka pa Jabulon. <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />Ci abiywayo Cicera, lawimony pa Jabin, akelo karomo kwedi i dog kulu Kicon kacel ki gadigadi lwenye ki buca monye ducu, ci abimiye i cingi.’” <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Barak owaco ki Debora ni, “Ka in aye ibicito kweda, ci abicito; ento ka in pe ibicito kweda, an pe abicito.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Debora ogamo doge ni, “An abicito kwedi ada; ento wot ma i cito iyeni deyone pe bibedo meri, pien Rwot bimiyo Cicera i cing dako.” Ci Debora oa, owoto ki Barak wa i Kedec. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Ci Barak olwongo jo Jabulon ki jo Naputali ki i Kedec, ci jo alip apar gucito bote gulubu kore; kitmeno Debora bene ocito kacel kwedgi.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Ikare meno onongo Keber ma jo Kenit opoke woko ki bot jo Keni mukeneni ma gin likwayo pa Kobab ma jo paoc Moses, ci onongo en oguru kemane kamabor inget yat kworo ma i Jaananim, macok ki Kedec.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Ka kitito bot Cicera ni Barak wod pa Abinoam ocito i got Tabor, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />ci Cicera olwongo wegi gadigadi nyonyone ducu ma giromo miya abongwen, ki jo ducu ma gitye bote, ni gua ki i Karocet-ka-goyim gubin i kulu Kicon. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Debora owaco ki Barak ni, “A malo, pien tin aye nino ma Rwot obimiyo iye Cicera i cingi. Rwot aye bitelo nyimi.” Kitmeno Barak ocako lor piny ki iwi got Tabor kacel ki dano alip apar ma gilubu kore. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />Ci Rwot obwango kom Cicera ki wegi gadigadine ducu, kacel ki monye ducu inyim Barak, ci guto ki ret me pala lucwan. Ento Cicera opye woko piny ki i gadigadine, oringo woko ki tyene. <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Barak olubu kor gadigadi ki monygi oo wa i Karocet-ka-goyim; mony pa Cicera kinekogi woko ducu ki pala lucwan, pe dano acel mo odong.<verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Cicera oringo ki tyene nio wa i kema pa Yayeri, dako pa Keber ma jo Kenit; pien yam onongo kuc tye ikin Jabin laloc me Kajor ki jo me ot pa Keber ma Lakenit. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Yayeri okati woko kajolo wiye ci owaco bote ni, “Loke idwog tung kany, ladita, pe ilwor.” Kitmeno omiyo Cicera odok bote wa i kemane, ci dakonu oume woko ki bongo. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Cicera owaco bote ni, “Kong imiya pii mo manok me amata, pien orwo pii tye kaneka.” Dakonu oyabo dog opiru cak, omiyo en aye omato, ka dok oume woko. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Ka Cicera dok owaco bote ni, “Cung i dogola kema. Ka ngat mo obino ce openyi ni, ‘ngati mo tye kany?’ Waci, ‘Pe.’” <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Ento Yayeri dako pa Keber okwanyo loc lagur kema, ka dok omako nyol i cinge, ci ocito bote mot, oguru loc i tur nyime tungcel, nio ka otuc pil wa i ngom, pien onongo en onino matek pi olo. Kitmeno omiyo en oto woko. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Ci nen, ka Barak obino matye kalubu kor Cicera. Yayeri ocito woko kajolo wiye ci owaco ni, “Bin, wek anyuti dano ma itye kayenyoneni.” Odonyo i kemane, ci onongo Cicera oto woko, obutu piny kenyo kun loc ocung i tur nyime.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Kitmeno Lubanga otayo Jabin laloc me Kanaan ki inyim jo Icrael inino meno, <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />ci jo Icrael gumedo kerogi pi diyo Jabin laloc me Kanaan matek nio ka gutyekogi woko.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s1">Wer pa Debora gin ki Barak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Debora ki Barak wod pa Abinoam guwayo wer akero inino meno ni.<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />“Luwimony gutelo wi Icrael,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:2">dano gubino ma gudyero komgi keken gi; kipak Rwot!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Wuwiny, wun luker!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Wuter itwu, wun luloc!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">Abiywayo akero bot Rwot</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:3">abiwero ki dwon mamit bot Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />Rwot, ikare ma ikato woko ki i Ceir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">ikare ma i coro ia ki i dye lobo Edom,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">lobo ocako yenge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">polo bene ocwero pii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:4">i ada do, pol ocako cwer.<verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:18">Nia 19:18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godi guyenge ki inyim Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:5">Cinai oyenge kuca ki inyim Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Ikare pa Camgar wod pa Anat,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">ki ikare pa Yayeri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">luwot gubedo pe i yoo gudu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:6">jo ma giwoto me cito kamo giwire ki i yoo matino.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Dano gutum woko ki i Icrael ikin paco,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:7">gutum, gutum woko do, nio ka in Debora ibino,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:7">i tuc ma in i mego me ada kikome i Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Ikare ma guyero lubanga mogogu manyen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">ci mony oo wa i dog gang.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:8">Kwot mo, onyo tong mo, yam onen ikin jo Icrael alip pyere angwen ni?<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />Cwinya olwodo lok ikom luwimony pa Icrael</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:9">ma gudyero komgi ikin lwak.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:9">Kipak Rwot!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Wun lungwec ki kana ma tari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">wun lubed ikom bongi ma kideyo ma kwari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">ki wun luwot ki tyen i yoo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:10">wutit loke ba!<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />Wuwiny dwon luwer kama gitwomo iye pii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">kunu gin pako kit ma Rwot oloyo ki mony,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">ki kit ma jo Icrael guloyo ki lukworgi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:11">Ikarenu jo pa Rwot gucito piny wa i dog taun madito.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Debora we, coo woko, coo woko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">Coo woko, coo woko, icak wer!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">A malo, Barak, itel wi opiini ma iyako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:12">in wod pa Abinoam!<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Ludito ma odong gucako wot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:13">jo pa Rwot gucito kalweny pire ikom oteka.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Jo Epraim gucito guo wa i nota,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">i korwu wun jo Benjamin ki lutuwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">luwimony pa jo Makir gubino piny,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:14">lumak odoo ker gua ki i Jabulon.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Rwodi pa jo Icakar gubino ki Debora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Jo Icakar gucung matek ikom Barak;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">ci gutware i kore wa i nota.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">Ento jo me kaka pa Reuben</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:15">gubedo ki gung ic.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Pingo ibedo i dye dwol romi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">kawinyo nyamulere ma gikutu i kor lim?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:16">Jo me kaka pa Reuben gubedo ki gung ic.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Gilead odong loka Jordan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">gin ango ma omiyo Dan obedo mere i mel?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">Acer obedo mere mot i dog nam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:17">obedo kun otoyo toke iwang wate.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Jo Jabulon aye lwak ma gudyero komgi i to;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:18">ki jo Naputali bene iwi cere ma i dye bar.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Luker gubino, gulwenyo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">Luker me Kanaan gulwenyo matek i karenu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">i Taanak, inget pii me Megiddo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:19">ento pe gunongo lonyo me ayaka.<verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Lakalatwe gulwenyo ki i polo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:20">gulwenyo ikom Cicera kun gilubu gergi.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Kulu Kicon oterogi woko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:21">wi biamwonyi mageri, Kicon mageri.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:21">Abimede kiwot anyim ki teka ducu!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Aguragura gimoro piny ki obong tyen gi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:22">kun gipye, gikire kwede;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:22">aguragurane gipye, gikire.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />Lamalaika pa Rwot owaco ni, kicen Meroj,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">kicen lubedo iye matek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">pien pe guringo i oduru pa Rwot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:23">pi konyo Rwot ki lweny ikom oteka.<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Yayeri kimiye gum makato mon ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:24">dako pa Keber Lakenit;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:24">ikin mon ducu ma gibedo i kema in lakome gum.<verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Ka Cicera dok olege pii, ci en omiye cak,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:25">okele cak lukulu i awal maber ma opore pi rwot.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Omako loc kema i cinge,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">cinge ma lacuc otingo nyol pa lutic;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:26">ogoyo ki wi Cicera, otyero, ocanyo, otucu tur nyime pil.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Okule piny, ci opoto, obutu lilwe katyene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">okule katyene, opoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:27">opoto oto kama okule iyeni.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Dako opiro wange ki iwang dirica</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">min Cicera okiyo ki iwang ot, kun owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Pingo tin gadigadine pe tye kadwogo oyot ce?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:28">Pingo tyen gadigadine pe mor bino oyot?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Ci mon ma luryeko ingete gudoke iye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:29">en bene ogamo doge kekene kun cuku cwinye ni,<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Koni gunongo lim, gitye kapokone, onyo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">anyaka acel pi twon acel acel, nyo kidodo aryo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">bongo ma ngwalangwala pi Cicera, ma giyako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">bongo ma ngwalangwala ma kidero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:30">bongi aryo ma kidero me abola i nguta.’<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Lumeroki ducu myero gutum woko kitmeno, ai Rwot!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 5:31">Ento luremi gubed macalo ceng matuc ki kerone.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JDG 5:31" />
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Inge meno lobo oywe pi mwaka pyere angwen.<verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s1">Lubanga olwongo Gideon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Ka jo Icrael dok gutimo gin manen marac inyim Rwot, ci Rwot omiyogi i cing jo Midian pi mwaka abiro. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Jo Midian gubwoyo jo Icrael woko, ma omiyo jo Icrael guyubu kakanegi wa ikin godi, ki i boro wa ki i kabedo mogo ma kicelo matek, pi lworo jo Midian. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Ikare ducu ma jo Icrael gicoyo iye kodi, en aye kare ma jo Midian ki jo Amalek ki jo ma tung kunyango gibino gicore kamonyogi. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Jonu gitongo gonygi cok kwedgi, ka gibalo cam ma i potogi o kwede wa kamacok ki Gaja, kun pe giweko cam mo dong ma konyo bot jo Icrael, kadi wa ma romi nyo dyangi nyo kana gitwero camone i lobo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Gin gibino ki limgi makwo, wa ki kemagi; ma nongo gibino ma gucido piny woko macalo bonyo, ma kwanogi pe yot wa kikwano wel kinagagi loyo dano woko bene; ka gubino ci gibalo lobo woko liweng. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Kitmeno jo Midian gumiyo piny orem ki bot jo Icrael woko, oweko jo Icrael gukok bot Rwot ni okonygi.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Ikare ma jo Icrael gukok bot Rwot pi aroma pa jo Midian, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />ci Rwot ocwalo botgi lanebi, ma owaco botgi ni, “Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael owaco kit man ni, ‘Yam atelo wiwu akwanyowu ki i Ejipt ki i ot kol me bedo opii. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Yam alarowu ki i cing jo Ejipt ki i cing jo ma gubedo kaunuwu ducu; aryemogi woko ki inyimwu kun amiyo lobogi botwu. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Ikare ca awaco botwu ni an aye a Rwot Lubangawu, pe wubiworo lwak lubanga pa jo Amor ma kombedi wubedo i lobogini. Ento wun pe wumedo ki woro doga.’”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Ikare meno lamalaika pa Rwot obino obedo ite kworo matye i Opra, gang pa Yoaci ma jo Abiejer. Ci wode Gideon onongo tye kadino ngano i bur biyo olok wek jo Midian pe gunene. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Lamalaika pa Rwot onen bote, kun owaco bote ni, “Rwot tye kwedi, in twon oteka lweny.” <verse eid="JDG 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Ci Gideon owaco bote ni, “Tima kica ba, ladit, ‘Ka Rwot tye kwedwa, pingo lwak jami magi maracuni ducu opoto ikomwa? Lwak tic ducu me aura mayam Rwot otiyo, ma kwariwa gutito botwa pire ni, dong tye kwene? Kiwaco ni yam Rwot aye okwanyowa ki i lobo Ejipt, ento kombedi Rwot dong obolowa woko tenge liyak, omiyowa i cing jo Midian.’” <verse eid="JDG 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Ci Rwot oloke odok tung bote, kun wace ni, “Cit ki tek ma ikomini, wek icit ilar jo Icrael ki i cing jo Midian. An kikoma aye acwali.” <verse eid="JDG 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Ci Gideon ogamo doge ni, “Tima kica ba, Rwot. An atwero laro jo Icrael ningning? Nen ba, kakawa tye matidi mo ikin jo Manace, dok an aye latin matidine ki i dogolawa.” <verse eid="JDG 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Ci Rwot owaco bote ni, “Ento an aye abibedo kwedi; dok ibineko jo Midian ducu macalo obedo dano acel keken.” <verse eid="JDG 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Gideon owaco ni, “Ka dong anongo gum ki boti, dong imiya lanyut mo ma moko ni in aye iloko kweda. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Tim ber, pe kong ia woko ki kany nio ka abino boti kun akelo ki in mota me aketa inyimi.” Ci en ogamo doge ni, “Abibedo nio ka idwogo.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Gideon ocito i ode, ka otedo latin dyel mo, ki capat ma tobi pe iye ma kitedo ki moko kwon maromo debe aryo. Oketo ringo i aduku, oonyo pige i agulu, ka okelo odyero bot lamalaika pa Rwot ite kworo, kama en oketo inyime. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Ci lamalaika pa Rwot owaco bote ni, “Kwany ringo ki capat ma tobi pe iyeni, i ketgi ikom pata got man, ka ionyo pige i wiye.” Gideon otimo kitmeno. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Ka dong lamalaika pa Rwot ocwalo odoo matye i cinge, omiyo wiye ogudu ringo ki capat ma tobi pe iyeni. Ci mac olyel, oa ki ikom pata got, owango ringo ki capat ma tobi pe iyeni woko. Lacen lamalaika pa Rwot orwenyo woko ki i wange. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Ma omiyo Gideon oniang ni man lamalaika pa Rwot; ci owaco ni, “Maa do, ai Rwot Lubanga! Pien nen dong aneno lamalaika pa Rwot wang ki wang.” <verse eid="JDG 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Ento Rwot owaco bote ni, “Kuc obed boti. Pe ilwor; pe ibito.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Ci Gideon ocano keno tyer kunu pi Rwot, ocako nyinge ni, “Rwot aye Kuc.” Pud tye ocung i Opra, gang pa jo Abiejer wa onyo.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />I dyewor meno Rwot owaco bote ni, “Kwany twoni pa woru, twon me aryone myero mwaka me dite obed maromo abiro, ci i muk keno tyer pa jok Baal matye bot woru woko, itong yat ma kicomo ingete pi woro jok ma dako ma kilwongo ni Acera. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Ci ican keno tyer pi Rwot Lubangani iwi lobo ma kitoro ma otinge malo, kun icano got kore kikore. Ka dong ikwany twon me aryone, ityer me gitum awanga; yat me awora ma ibitongo ireto woko pinyi bidoko yen me lawang gitum.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Kitmeno Gideon otero jo apar ki ikin lutice, otimo kit ma Rwot ocike kwede; ento pi lworo lutugi ki jo ma i taun meno pe otiyo i dyeceng, en otiyo i dyewor.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Ka dano ma i taun meno gua malo odiko con, ci nen, keno tyer pa jok Baal kimuku woko, ki wir yat me woro jok ma dako Acera ma kangete bene kitongo woko, ki twon me aryone kityero woko iwi keno tyer ma kicanoni. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Ci lwak gucako lok keken gi ni, “Anga mono ma otimo kuman ni?” Lacen ka dong gutyeko yenyo kore kun gipenyo dano, ci guwaco ni, “Gideon wod pa Yoaci aye otimo kuman.”<verse eid="JDG 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Ci jo ma i gang meno guwaco bot Yoaci ni, “Kel wodi woko kany wek kineke, pien omuku keno tyer pa Baal woko, dok otongo wa wir yat me woro jok ma dako Acera ma kangeteni.” <verse eid="JDG 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Ento Yoaci owaco bot jo ducu ma gurye cok ikome ni, “Wun aye wubilweny pi Baal bo? Wun wubicung ikome? Ngat ma bilweny pire kibineke woko i odiko. Ka en aye lubanga, wek en olweny gire kene, pien keno tyere aye dong kimuku woko.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Pimeno kicako nying Gideon ni Jerubaal inino meno, ma teloke ni, “Wek Baal olweny kwede,” pien omuku keno tyere woko.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Ka dong jo Midian ducu ki jo Amalek ki jo ma tung kunyango gucoke, gungolo kulu Jordan ci gugony i nota me Jejreel. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Ento Cwiny pa Rwot obino ikom Gideon; ka okutu tum ci jo Abiejer gucoke i kore. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Ci ocwalo kwena oromo kin jo Manace ducu, gin bene gucoke i kore. Ka dok ocwalo kwena bot jo Acer, jo Jabulon ki jo Naputali; ci gucito karwate kwedgi.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Ci Gideon owaco bot Lubanga ni, “Kace ibilaro jo Icrael ki i cinga kit ma iwaconi, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />ci nen, aketo yer romo piny i laro moyo en. Kace toyo opong i yer romo keken, kun i ngom ducu otwo woko, ci abingeyo ni ibilaro jo Icrael ki cinga, kit macalo iwaconi.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Ci obedo kitmeno. Ka oa malo odiko con, en obiyo yer romo, oliyo toyo ki i yer romo ma opongo awal kwon woko. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Ka dok Gideon owaco bot Lubanga ni, “Pe kiniga omaki ikoma. Wek dok alok kuman tyen acel keken. Wek kong dok atem ki yer romo kicel. Alegi ni, wek yer romo keken aye obed ma otwo, ento toyo oluk ikom ngom ducu ma kenyo.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Ci Lubanga otimo kitmeno i dyewor meno; onongo yer romo keken aye otwo, ento ngom ducu toyo oluk iye.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s1">Jo pa Gideon guloyo jo Midian</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Jerubaal, ma en aye Gideon, ki jo ducu ma onongo gitye bote gua malo odiko con, ci gugony inget wang pii me Karod. Gony pa jo Midian onongo tye inyimgi tung kumalo, inget got More ki i nota.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />Rwot owaco bot Gideon ni “Jo ma gitye kwedini gipol mada ki tung bota. Ka abimiyo jo Midian i cinggi gibiwake gingwete ikoma ni meno ‘Cingwa ki komwa gire aye olarwa.’ <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:8">Nwo 20:8</ref></char></note>Pimeno kombedi dong itit bot lwak ni, ‘ngat mo ma lworo omako, ma kome myel ber oa odok i gange.’” Kitmeno Gideon oomo cwinygi, ci dano alip pyere aryo wiye aryo gudok woko, ci dano alip apar gudong.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Rwot dok owaco bot Gideon ni. “Itye ki lwaki pud pol mada; tergi i dog pii ci abiyekogi ki kunu ci ngat ma abiwaco ni, ‘Dano man bicito kwedi’ en aye bicito kwedi; ki ngat an abiwace ni, ‘Dano man pe bicito kwedi,’ en pe bicito kwedi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Kitmeno Gideon otero dano i dog pii; ci Rwot owaco bote ni, “Dano acel acel ma bigweto pii ki cinge ka nango ki lebe macalo gwok nango kwede ibiketo en cung kene; ki ngat ma orumu conge piny kamato pii bene kitmeno.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Ci wel dano ma gugweto pii ki cinggi ka gunango ki lebgi macalo gwok guromo miya adek; ento lwak jo mudongi ducu gurumu conggi ka gumato pii. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Rwot owaco bot Gideon ni, “An abilarowu ki jo miya adek ma gugweto pii ki cinggi ni ka gunango calo gwok, pi miyo jo Midian i cingwu. Dong iwek jo mukeneni ngat acel acel odok gire i pacone.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Gideon ogamo abino pa lwak woko ki i cinggi wa ki tumgi; ci ocwalo jo Icrael mudong i paco, kun dano acel acel cito gire i kemane. En odong ki jo miya adeki, kun gony pa jo Midian tye piny i nota.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />I dyewor meno Rwot owaco bote ni, “A malo, icit ilweny ikom gony pa jo Midian, pien dong atyeko miyone i cingi. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Ento ka ilworo cito piny kunu keni, ci icit i gonygi kacel ki latici Pura. <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />Ci ibiwinyo gin ma jonu giloko, ci lacen cwinyi bilimo tek me cito kamonyo gonygi.” En ocito piny ki latice Pura, ci guo i agiki gony kama lumony magi gubutu iye. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Jo Midian, jo Amalek ki jo ducu ma gua tung kunyango onongo guryeyo gonygi i nota meno ma gumone macalo lwak bonyo; ki kinagagi bene welgi pe kwane, dok gipol macalo kweyo me dog nam. <verse eid="JDG 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Ka Gideon oo, dano mo ocako tito leke mo bot lawote, kun waco ni, “Nen, aleko lek mo ni; mugati me cayiri ma olunge opoto i gonywa kun lor alora, obino kwede wa ikom kema, ci oreto kemawa woko piny, oloko ataro, ci kema opyele bene woko piny.” <verse eid="JDG 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Ci lawote ogamo ni, “Man pala lucwan pa Gideon wod pa Yoaci, Laicrael; en enu kikome. Lubanga dong otyeko miyo jo Midian ki lwak monygi ducu woko i cinge.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Ka Gideon owinyo kit ma gitito kwede lek ki kit ma gigonyo kwede tere, ci en ogungo piny ka ocako miyo woro bot Lubanga. Lacen odwogo gin ki Pura latice i gony pa jo Icrael, ci owaco ni, “Wua malo, pien Rwot dong omiyo mony pa jo Midian woko i cingwu.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Ci Gideon opoko kin jo miya adeki i lwak buca mony adek, ka dok omiyo tum i cinggi ducu, ki abino ma igi nono, ki mac raa i abino ducu. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Ka dok ocikogi ni, wacito wek warumu kema pa lumerokwa woko, ka dok owaco ni, “Wunena, ci wun bene wutim kit ma an abitimo kwede ka dong wao cok inget gonygi. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Ka akutu tum, an kacel ki jo ma atye kwedgi ducu, ci wun bene wukut tum ma dong wurumu gony ducu dyere kun wudange ni, ‘Pi Rwot ki pi Gideon!’”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Gideon ki jo miya acel ma gitye bote guo cok inget gony pa jo Midian ikine ka cawa me cwiny dyewor ma onongo pud guketo Lukurpiny aketa; ci gucako kutu tum ki tyero abino matye i cinggi ducu. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Ci buca monygi adek ducu gukutu tumgi, gutyero abinogi woko ka gumako mac raa i cinggi ma lacam ki tum me akuta i cinggi ma lacuc, kun gidange kwede ni, “Pala lucwan pi Rwot ki pi Gideon!” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Dano acel acel ocung mot i kabedone ma gurumu gonygi ducu, ci mony pa jo Midian guringo woko ducu; gucako dange, guringo kwede woko ata. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Ka dano miya adek ca gitye kakutu tumgi, Rwot oloko pala lucwan pa jo Midian ikom lutugi keken gi ki ikom monygi ducu. Monygi oringo o wa i Bet-cita, ma tung Jerera, ki o kwede wa iwang lobo me Abel-mekola inget Tabat.<verse eid="JDG 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Ci gulwongo jo Icrael ki i kaka pa Naputali, Acer wa ki pa Manace ducu, ci guryemo kor jo Midian. <verse eid="JDG 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gideon ocwalo kwena i lobo godi ducu me Epraim kun waco ni, “Wubin, wulweny ikom jo Midian, wukurgi iwang wat ducu o wa i Bet-bara ki i Jordan bene.” Kitmeno gulwongo jo Epraim ducu ci gumako wang wat ducu oo wa i Bet-bara ki Jordan bene. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Ci gumako luker pa jo Midian aryo, Oreb ki Jeeb; ci guneko Oreb i pata got pa Oreb, ki Jeeb guneko i bur biyo olok pa Jeeb. Lacen gukelo wi Oreb ki Jeeb loka Jordan bot Gideon.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s1">Guloyo jo Midian matwal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Jo Epraim guwaco bot Gideon ni, “Itime ikomwa kuman pingo? Nen pe ilwongowa ikare ma onongo icito kalweny ikom jo Midian.” Ci gugere ikome matek. <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Ento en owaco botgi ni, “Gin ango ma tin atimo ma kiporo ki gin ma wun wutimo? Pe gwero kor olok pa Epraim ber makato olok ducu ma Abiejer opwono? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:11">Jab 83:11</ref></char></note>Lubanga omiyo luker pa jo Midian i cingwu, Oreb ki Jeeb, ci gin ango ma an abedo katimo ma pore ki wun?” Ka oloko kitmeno, ci kinigagi ocako dok cen ikome.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Ka Gideon obino i Jordan, okato loka ca, en kacel ki dano miya adek ma gitye boteni. Komgi ducu oloc woko, ento onongo pud giryemo kor jo Midian. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Piman omiyo en owaco bot jo me Cukot ni. “Alegowu wumii mugati bot dano ma gilubu kora ni, pien komgi dong oloc woko, dok atye karyemo kor Jeba ki Jalmuna ma luker pa jo Midian.” <verse eid="JDG 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Ento rwodi ma i Cukot gugamo doge ni, “En Jeba ki Jalmuna mono dong gitye i cingi bo, ma weko wan wamiyo mugati bot joni?” <verse eid="JDG 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Ci Gideon ogamo doggi ni, “Ber yo, ka Rwot omiyo Jeba ki Jalmuna i cinga, ci abipwodo komwu ki okutu me tim ki okutu lango.” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Ka oa woko ki kunu, ci ocito wa i Penuel, ci dok oloko kwedgi lakite acelu. Jo me Penuel bene guwace lok marom ki kit ma jo Cukot gudok iye bote. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Ci Gideon owaco bot jo ma i Penuel ni, “Ka adwogo kany ki kuc, ci abimuku ot man ma ocudu maloni woko.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Ikare meno onongo Jeba ki Jalmuna gitye i Karkor, kacel kimonygi maromo jo alip apar wiye abic, gin jo ducu mayam gubwot ki ikom mony ducu pa jo me tung kunyango. Onongo dong kineko lumonygi maromo alip miya acel ki pyere aryo ma gin lwenyo ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Gideon olubu yoo ma jo ma gibedo i kema gimaro wok ki iye ma wok ki inget Noba ki Jogbea tung kunyango, ci olwenyo ki monygi ma gutoyo tokgi ata. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Ci Jeba ki Jalmuna guringo woko ci en oryemo korgi, omako gin luker pa jo Midian aryonu ducu, ci lok man okelo lworo ki atiba ikom monygi ducu.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Lacen Gideon wod pa Yoaci odwogo ki i lweny kun lubu yoo ma giito iye i Kerec. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Ki kunu en omako awobi mo ma Lacukot, openye, ci awobini ocoyo nying rwodi ki ludongo me Cukot ducu, ma giromo dano pyere abiro wiye abiro. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Gideon obino bot ludongo me Cukot, ci owaco botgi ni, “Dong wunen Jeba ki Jalmuna mayam wungala pirgi kun wuwaco ni, ‘Jeba ki Jalmuna dong gitye i cingi bo, ma weko wamiyo mugati bot joni ma komgi oloc woko ni?’ ” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Ci omako ludongo ma i taun madit meno, ka okwanyo okutu me tim ki okutu lango, opwodo kwede jo Cukot. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Ka dok omuku ot ma ocudu malo ma i Penuel, ka oneko co ma i taun madit meno woko liweng.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Ka dok owaco bot Jeba ki Jalmuna ni, “Jo mayam wunekogi i Tabor onongo gubedo kit dano ango?” Gudoke iye ni. “Kit ma itye kwedeni, gin bene onongo gitye kitmeno; ngat acel acel ikin gi onongo nen calo awobi pa ladit latela maber.” <verse eid="JDG 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Gideon ogamo ni, “Gin omegina kikome, awobe pa maa. Macalo Rwot tye makwoni, kono yam pe wunekogi, kono pe anekowu bene.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Ka dok owaco bot wode Jeter ma latin kayone ni, “A malo, inekgi woko.” Ento latin awobi pe owoto pala lucwane, pien lworo omake woko; en onongo pud tidi mo. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Ci Jeba ki Jalmuna guwace ni, “In aye ia malo kikomi, wek i nekwa; pien kit ma laco tye kwede, tek kome bene tye kitmeno.” Ma omiyo Gideon oa malo oneko Jeba ki Jalmuna woko, ci okwanyo mola cal dwe mayam guruku i ngut kinagagi.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Inge meno jo Icrael guwaco bot Gideon ni, “Dong ibed lalocwa, in kikomi, ki wodi ki likwayi bene, pien ityeko larowa ki i cing jo Midian.” <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Ento Gideon owaco botgi ni, “An pe abiloyowu, ki woda bene pe biloyowu; Rwot aye biloyowu gire.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Ka dok Gideon owaco botgi ni, “Wek alegwu gin mo acel. Ber ngat acel acel omiya mola it me jabu ma oyako.” (Onongo lumerokgi gitye ki jabu me aruka i it, pien onongo gin jo Icmael.) <verse eid="JDG 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Gugamo ni, “Wabimiyo ki yomcwiny.” Gupeto ginaruka piny, ci dano acel acel obolo iye jabu me it ma guyako. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Pek me jabu me aruka i it ma en olegoni oromo cekel alip acel ki miya abiro, ma pe kiribo iye mola cal dwe, ki mola aruka maryeny aryenya, ki bongi aruka ma lamarlamar ma luker me Midian aye giruku, dok ma pe giribo iye mola ma gitweyo i ngut kinagagi. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Gideon otimo ki epod, ka dok ocibo i gange matye i Opra, ci jo Icrael ducu guworo cal ateta meno ma ka woro Lubanga, ma omiyo oloke odoko owic me ciko Gideon ki jo me ode. <verse eid="JDG 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Kitmeno jo Icrael guloyo jo Midian, ma pe dong guilo wigi malo me kelo ayela ikomgi matwal. Ikare pa Gideon lobo oywe woko ki i aroma ki lweny pi mwaka pyere angwen.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Gideon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Jerubaal, ma en aye Gideon wod pa Yoaci, ocito obedo i ode. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Onongo Gideon ceng tye ki awobene pyere abiro ma gin nyodone kikome, pien en onongo tye ki mon mapol. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Gideon obedo bene ki dakone ma angeca ma bedo i Cekem. Dakonu bene onywalo kwede latin laco ci Gideon ocako nyinge Abimelek.<verse eid="JDG 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gideon wod pa Yoaci oto madong otii woko likong kong, ci kiyike i lyel pa wone Yoaci i lobo Opra ma en taun pa jo Abiejer.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Ka Gideon dong oto woko, cutcut jo Icrael guloke dok gucako woro jogi Baal mapatpat ma ka woro Lubangagi, ci guketo Baal-berit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="fk">Baal-berit </char> te loke Baal me gicike.</note> me bedo lubangagi. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Jo Icrael pe dong gupo ikom Rwot Lubangagi, mayam olarogi ki i cing lumerokgi tungi ki tungi; <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />dok pe gubedo ki cwiny maber bot lutino pa Jerubaal, ma en aye Gideon, pi gin ducu maber mayam en otimo pi jo Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s1">Loc pa Abimelek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Ikare meno Abimelek wod pa Jerubaal ocito i Cekem bot jo paneyone ci otito botgi, ki bot jo ma i dogola pa minegi ducu ni, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Wuwac lok man bot jo ma i taun me Cekem ducu wek guwiny ni, ‘Mene maber ki botwu? Myero awobe pa Jerubaal ma giromo pyere abiro ni ducu gubed lulowu, nyo myero ngat acel aye olowu?’ Ento wiwu wupo ni, an a cogowu, dok a ringo komwu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Jo paneyone guloko lok meno ducu pire, kun gin omiyo jo Cekem ducu guwinyo; ci cwinygi oloke kalubu kor Abimelek, pien guwaco ni, “En aye ominwa.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Gumiyo bote lim ryal pyere abiro ma kikwanyo ki i ot pa Baal-berit. En aye Abimelek obedo kaculu kwede jo ma kitgi atata ma lubwami ma guribe ikome. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />En ocito i gang pa wone i Opra, ci oneko omegine awobe pa Jerubaal, jo pyere abiro, ki ikom pata got mo acel. Ento Yocam wod pa Gideon matidine aye odong, pien onongo okane woko. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Lacen jo Cekem ducu gubino gucoke kacel, gin kacel ki jo Bet-millo ducu, ci gucito guketo Abimelek me bedo laloc inget kworo ma i Cekem kama wir jok ocung i ngeteni.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Carolok ikom yadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Ka kitito loke bot Yocam, ci en ocito ocung malo iwi got Gerijim, ka odange matek kun waco botgi ni. “Kong wuwiny loka, wun jo Cekem, wek Lubanga bene owiny dogwu. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Inino mo acel lwak yadi gucito kawiro moo ker ikom lalocgi. Ci guwaco bot yat jeituni ni, ‘In aye ilowa.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Ento yat jeituni ogamo doggi ni, ‘Abiweko moona mabupi ma kimiyo kwede deyo bot lubangagu ki bot dano, wek acit alyere iwi yadi bo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Yadi dok guwaco bot oduru ni, ‘In aye ibin ilowa.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Ento oduru ogamo doggi ni, ‘Abiweko nyiga mamiti ki mabeconi, wek acit alyere iwi yadi bo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Ka yadi guwaco bot olok ni, ‘In aye ibin ilowa.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Ento olok ogamo doggi ni, ‘Abiweko kongo bwinona ma yomo cwiny lubangagu ki danoni, wek acit alyere iwi yadi bo?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Ka dok yadi ducu guwaco bot abelwinyo ni, ‘In aye ibin ilowa.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Ci abelwinyo owaco bot yadi ni, ‘Ka wutye kawira ki moo me bedo lalocwu ki cwiny me ada, ci dong wubin, wunong kalare ite tipuna; ento ka pe kumeno, ci wek mac oa ki bot abelwinyo owang yadi cedar me Lebanon woko.’”<verse eid="JDG 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />“Dong apenyo wun ba, ikare ma wuketo Abimelek me bedo laloci, yam wutiyo ki cwiny me ada, kun iwu leng? Yam wutimo Jerubaal maber mono, kacel ki jo me ode ducu, ma rwate ki tic ma mere macon ca? <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />Pien i ada, wora olwenyo pirwu kun odyero kwone, en olarowu ki i cing jo Midian, <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />ci tini wutware lijur kalweny ikom ot pa wora, ma wuneko awobene woko ma giromo pyere abiro ki ikom pata got acelu, ka dok wuketo Abimelek ma wod pa angecane aye me bedo laloc maloyo Cekem pi bedo watwu. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Pimeno, ka wutiyo ki Jerubaal ki jo me ode ki cwiny me ada tini kun iwu leng, ci wubed ki yomcwiny ikom Abimelek, en bene cwinye obed yom ikomwu. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Ento ka pe kumeno, wek mac obin oa ki bot jo Cekem ki Bet-millo, owang Abimelek woko.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Ka Yocam otyeko loko loke man en oringo gire woko kun laro kome, ci ocito wa i Beer, pi lworo omine Abimelek.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kit ma Abimelek opoto kwede ki i loc i Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Abimelek oloyo jo Icrael pi mwaka adek. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Lacen Lubanga ocwalo cwiny marac ikin Abimelek ki jo Cekem, ci jo Cekem gucako tim me robo dog ikom Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Kitmeno tim bwami mayam kitimo ikom awobe pa Jerubaal maromo pyere abiro ca obino ci opoto ikom Abimelek ma omingini mayam onekogi, jami man ducu otiine wek alii me remogi obed ikome ki ikom jo Cekem mayam gumiye tekcwiny me neko omegine. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Jo Cekem guketo dano gubutu kakure i yoo matye iwi godi. Jonu gubedo kayako jo ducu ma giwoto gikato ki ingetgi i yoo kunu; ci Abimelek owinyo loke.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Ikare meno Gaal wod pa Ebed odak kacel ki lutugi, gubino i Cekem, ci jo Cekem gugene. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Gucito i potogi, ci gupwono nyig olok, ka gunyono, ci gubiyo pige, ikare ma guyubu nino madit, ci gucito gudonyo kwede i ot pa lubangagi, ka gucamo kun gumato ci guyeto Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Gaal wod pa Ebed owaco ni, “Abimelek kono anga? Wan jo Cekem wan angagi ka? Lok ango kono mamiyo waworo en? Wod pa Jerubaal ki Jebul latice yam pe guworo jo pa Kamor ma won Cekem? Pingo dok myero wabed kaworo en kono? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Kono jo kany tye ite loca, kono akwanyo Abimelek woko. Kono awaco bot Abimelek ni, ‘Med monyi ci ikati woko kalweny kweda!’”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Ka Jebul ma lalo taun madit meno owinyo lok pa Gaal wod pa Ebed, ci kiniga omake cut. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Ci ocwalo kwena bot Abimelek i Aruma kun waco bote ni, “Nen, Gaal wod pa Ebed ki lutugi gubino i Cekem, gitye karubu taun maditi woko pi lweny ikomi. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Pimeno wua woko, in kacel ki dul mony matye boti, ibin ibut ikurgi i poto. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Odiko ka ceng pud tuc atucani, a woko con, ipot ikom taun madit meno. Ka en ki jo matye boteni gubino kalweny ikomi, ci in dong itimgi kitmeno ka komgi owec.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Abimelek ki jo ma gitye kwede ducu gua i dyewor, gucito gubutu pi lweny ikom Cekem kun onongo en opoko buca monye i dul angwen. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />I odiko me ninonu Gaal wod pa Ebed okato woko, ka ocung kama kidonyo kwede i dog gang; ci Abimelek ki dano ma gitye bote gua ki kama gubutu iye kakurugini. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Ka Gaal oneno jonu tye katware bino abina ci en, owaco bot Jebul ni, “Nen dano ca ma gibino gilor piny ki iwi godi!” Ento Jebul owace ni, “In ibineno meri tipu godi macalo danoni.” <verse eid="JDG 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Gaal dok owaco ni, “Nen, dano gitye kalor piny ki i dye lobo malo ca, kun buca acel bino a ki i tung te kworo wang ayweya ca.” <verse eid="JDG 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Ci Jebul dok owaco bote ni, “Dogi dok tye kwene tin, in mayam iwaco ni, ‘Abimelek kono anga, wek wawore?’ Meno pe gin jo ma in icayogini? Kong ikat woko kombedi, wek icit ilweny kwedgi.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Ci Gaal ocako cito kun telo wi mony pa jo Cekem, ocako lweny ikom Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimelek ocako ryeme, ci en oringo olaro kome. Jo mapol gupoto ma ret omakogi, oo wa i dog taun madit meno. <verse eid="JDG 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Abimelek odok obedo Aruma; ci Jebul oryemo Gaal ki lutugi woko, pe dok gubedo i Cekem.<verse eid="JDG 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Orwone dok dano ma gibedo Cekem gua me cito i potigi, ci man bene kitito pire bot Abimelek. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Cut en ocito ki jone, ma opokogi i buca mony adek, ci gubutu gukuru yoo poto. Ka guneno dano gibino gia ki i taun madit meno, ci gua gupoto ikomgi, gunekogi woko. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimelek ki dul dano ma gitye bote gucore guringo anyim, gucung i dog taun madit meno kakuru kama gidonyo ki iyeni, kun buca mony aryo mukeneni gicore ikom jo ducu ma gitye i poto, ci gunekogi woko. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimelek olwenyo ikom taun madit meno dyeceng benebene, ka omako woko, ci oneko jo ma gitye iye, omuku odigi woko liweng, ci opworo kado bene ikom ngom.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Ka jo ducu ma gibedo Migdal-cekem guwinyo loke, ci gudonyo gucito wapiny i kicika ma kigolo matye i ot pa jokgi El-berit. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Ci kitito bot Abimelek ni, nen ludongo ma i gangi ducu me Migdal-cekem gucoke kacel. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Ci Abimelek ocito iwi got Jalmon, en kacel ki dul monye ducu ma gitye bote, ci Abimelek omako latong gaji i cinge, ocito otongo kwede rido yen, ka otingo iwi gwoke ci owaco bot dul monye ma gitye kwede ni, “Kit ma wuneno atimoni, wun bene wutim oyotoyot kumeno.” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Kitmeno dano acel acel otongo rido yen, olubu ki kor Abimelek. Ci guketo iwi kabedo matek ma kigolo pinyi, ka gucwinyo mac ikom jonu, ma omiyo dano ducu ma gibedo i kabedo man me Migdal-cekem guto woko, i wel ma mito romo ka alip acel kulu, co wa ki mon.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Abimelek dok ocito Tebej, ka oguru woko dyere, ci omako. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Kunu yam tye iye ot matek ma ocudu malo i dye taun madit meno, ci lwak dano ma i gang ducu guringo gularo iye, co ducu wa ki mon, ci gucego wigi woko iye, gucito malo wa i dan ot ma ocudu maloni. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Ento Abimelek ocito wa i ka ot ma ocudu maloni, en ocako lweny ikom kabedo meno matek, ci onyiko cok ki dogolane wek ecwiny woko ki mac. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:21">2 Cam 11:21</ref></char></note>Ci dako mo obayo lakidi rego madit, ocelo ki wi Abimelek, otyero, obaro cogo wiye woko. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Ci en olwongo awobi matingo jami lwenye oyotoyot, ka ocako waco bote ni. “A i wot pala lucwani ineka woko, wek pe dano guwac ni: ‘Dako mamwani aye oneke.’” Awobinu ocobo kome pil, ci oneke woko. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Ka jo Icrael guneno ni Abimelek oto woko, ci guket, kun dano acel acel odok i gange. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Kitmeno Lubanga oculu wang bal ma Abimelek otimo ikom wone pi neko omegine pyere abiro. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Dok Lubanga bene odwoko tim pa jo Cekem maracenu ducu iwigi, omiyo lok pa Yocam wod pa Jerubaal ma ocenogi kwede ni ocobe ikomgi kakare.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s1">Tola ki Jair</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Ki inge Abimelek dano ma dok olaro jo Icrael en aye Tola wod pa Puwa, wod pa Dodo, ma jo Icakar. En yam bedo i Camir ma i lobo godi me Epraim. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />En obedo kangolo kop i Icrael pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye adek. Ka en oto woko, ci kiyike i Camir.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Dano ma olubu kore en aye Jair ma Lagilead. En obedo langolkop i Icrael pi mwaka pyere aryo wiye aryo. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />En yam tye ki awobene pyere adek ma giwoto ki kanagi pyere adek. Dok gubedo ki gangigi pyere adek bene ma pud kilwongo ni Kavot-jair nio wa onyo, ma gitye i lobo Gilead. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Ka Jair oto, ci kiyike i Kamon.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo Ammon guunu jo Icrael</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Jo Icrael dok gutimo gin manen marac inyim Rwot kun giworo jogi Baal mapatpat ki Acitarte, ki lubanga pa jo Ciria, jo Cidon, jo Moab, jo Ammon ki jo Piliciti; gubwoto lubu kor Rwot woko, ma pe dok bene guwore. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />Pimeno omiyo kiniga omako Rwot ikom jo Icrael, ci Rwot omiyogi woko i cing jo Piliciti ki jo Ammon. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Jonu gunginyo jo Icrael kun bene giunugi matek ikare me locgi ducu. Ci gubedo kaunu jo Icrael ducu ma gibedo loka Jordan i lobo pa jo Amor matye i lobo Gilead pi mwaka apar wiye aboro kulu. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Jo Ammon gungolo kulu Jordan kalweny wa ikom jo Juda bene, ki jo Benjamin ki jo me dogola pa Epraim, ma omiyo piny orem bot jo Icrael woko atikatika.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Lacen jo Icrael gukok bot Rwot kun giwaco ni, “Dong wabalo ikomi, pien wabwoto in Lubangawa woko, kun waworo jogi Baal mapatpat.” <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Ci Rwot owaco bot jo Icrael ni, “Yam pe an aye alarowu ki bot jo Ejipt, jo Amor, jo Ammon ki jo Piliciti? <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />Jo Cidon bene ki jo Amalek ki jo Maon yam guunuwu, ento ikare mayam wukok bota, ci alarowu ki i cinggi. <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Kadi bed kumeno, ci pud dok wubwota woko aye, kun wuworo lwak lubanga mukene. Pieno an pe dok abimede ki larowu. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Wucit wukok bot lwak lubanga mayam wuyeroni. Wek gin aye gularwu ki ikare manongo piny orem kwedwu.” <verse eid="JDG 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Ento jo Icrael guwaco bot Rwot ni, “Wan dong wapoto i bal adada, ci in dong i tim ikomwa kit ma i mito, ento walegi ni ilarwa tin.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Ci gucako bolo lwak lubanga pa lurok ma ikin gi ni woko; ka guworo Rwot; ci Rwot cwinye oton matek pi atwom ma jo Icrael gubedo kwede.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Ikare meno jo Ammon guywayo mony, gugony i Gilead, ci jo Icrael gucoke kacel, gugony i Mijpa. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Ludito pa jo Gilead gucako lok keken gi ni, “Dano mene ma bicako ki wan lweny ikom jo Ammon? Ci en bibedo lalo wi jo ma gibedo i Gilead ducu.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jeputa olaro jo Icrael ki i cing jo Ammon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Ikare meno Jeputa ma Lagilead obedo twon oteka lweny. Wone nyinge Gilead, ento mine obedo dako ma lakwele. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Dako pa Gilead ma kikwano ni dakone kikome bene onywalo awobe. Ka awobe pa dakonu gudongo, ci gin awobenu gutudu doggi wek giryem Jeputa woko, kun giwaco bote ni, “In pe ibileyo gin mo ma a i ot pa wonwa, pien in i wod pa dako mukene.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Ci Jeputa oringo woko ki bot omegine, ci ocito obedo gire i lobo Tob. Ki kunu lwak jo mogo ma kitgi obedo atata aye gucoke bote ci gucako tim me yak kwedgi.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Ka kare dong okato malac, ci nen jo Ammon gucako lweny ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Ka meno otime, ci ludongo pa jo Gilead gucito i lobo Tob kaomo Jeputa. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Ci guwaco bote ni, “Bin ibed latel wi monywa, wek walweny ki jo Ammon.” <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Ento Jeputa owaco botgi ni, “Yam wukwera woko, wun pe ceng oryema woko ki i ot pa wora, ka dok tin wubino bota pingo ma wutye ki can kumani?” <verse eid="JDG 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Ci ludongo pa jo Gilead guwaco bot Jeputa ni, “Meno aye gin ma omiyo tin wadwogo botini, wek in icit kwedwa kalweny ikom jo Ammon, ci ibed ladit maloyo jo ducu ma gibedo i Gilead.” <verse eid="JDG 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Ci Jeputa owaco botgi ni, “Ka wudwoka paco pi lweny ki jo Ammon, kace Rwot omiyogi i cinga, ci abibedo ladit maloyo wiwu.” <verse eid="JDG 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Ludongo me Gilead guwaco bot Jeputa ni, “Rwot aye obedo caden ikinwa; ka dok onenwa ka pe wabitiyo kit ma iwaconi i ada.” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Kitmeno Jeputa odok cen ki ludongo me Gilead, ci lwak guketo en me bedo lalo wigi ki latel wi monygi. Jeputa onwoyo loke ducu mayam owaconi inyim Rwot ki i Mijpa.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Ci Jeputa ocwalo lukwena bot laloc pa jo Ammon kun waco ni, “An abalo gin ango boti, ma omiyo ibino kalweny ki lobonani?” <verse eid="JDG 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Laloc pa jo Ammon ogamo dog lukwena pa Jeputa ni, “Pien ikare ma jo Icrael ceng gua ki i Ejipt gumayo lobona woko, cake wa ki i kulu Arnon o kwede wa i kulu Jabok ki i Jordan; ci ber tin wudwok lobona bota mot ki kuc.” <verse eid="JDG 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Ci Jeputa dok ocwalo lukwena bot laloc pa jo Ammon, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />kun waco bote ni, “Jeputa owaco kit man ni, jo Icrael yam pe gumayo lobo pa jo Moab kadi lobo pa jo Ammon, <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />ento ikare ma gua ki i Ejipt, jo Icrael guwok gubaro gigi dye tim oo wa i Nam Makwar, ka gucito i Kadec. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:14-21">Wel 20:14-21</ref></char></note>Lacen jo Icrael gucwalo lukwena bot latel me Edom ma kun giwaco ni, ‘Ber iwek wawok wakat ki i loboni.’ Ento latel lobo me Edom okwero winyone. Dok gucwalo kit kwena acelu bene bot latel me Moab, ci en bene pe oye. Kitmeno omiyo jo Icrael gubedo gigi i Kadec. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:4">Wel 21:4</ref></char></note>Ka dok guwoto gubaro dye tim, gurabo lobo Edom ki lobo Moab araba, ka guo kwede inget lobo Moab tung kunyango ci gugony loka kulu Arnon tungcel. Ento pe gudonyo i lobo Moab, pien kulu Arnon aye wang lobo pa jo Moab. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Ci <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-24">Wel 21:21-24</ref></char></note>jo Icrael dok gucwalo kwena bot Cikon, laloc pa jo Amor, ma gang kale Kecbon. Ci jo Icrael guwaco bote ni, ‘Ber iwek wawok wakat ki i loboni, wacit i lobowa.’ <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Ento Cikon iye ogung ikom jo Icrael, omiyo pe oye ni guwok gukat ki i lobone omiyo Cikon ocoko jone ducu, ogurugi kacel, ci gugony i Jakaj, ci olwenyo ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael omiyo Cikon ki lwake ducu i cing jo Icrael, ci guloyogi. Kitmeno jo Icrael gucamo lobo pa jo Amor ducu mayam gibedo i lobonu, odoko meggi. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Gucamo lobo pa jo Amor ducu cake ki i kulu Arnon o kwede wa i Jabok, ki dok cake ki i tim o wa i Jordan. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Kitmeno Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael oryemo jo Amor woko ki i lobogi ki inyim jone Icrael, ci in dok i mito ile kakagi bo? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Wun myero wucam lobo ma lubangawu Kemoc omiyowu me acama, ento wan wabicamo lobo ducu ma Rwot Lubangawa otyeko ryemo jo ma iye ki i nyimwa. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:1-6">Wel 22:1-6</ref></char></note>In aye mono iber makato Balak wod pa Jipor, laloc me Moab? En yam otube ikom jo Icrael? Nyo en yam ocako lweny ikomgi? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Ikare ma jo Icrael gubedo i Kecbon ki i gangi matino ma ingete, ki i Aroer ki i gangi matino ma ingete, ki i taun ducu ma i dog kulu Arnon pi mwaka miya adek kulu, pingo yam pe imayogi woko ikare ca? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />Kitmeno an gira pe atimo bal mo ikomi; in giri aye itima rac pi cako lweny ikoma. Rwot ma Langolkop aye ber dong ongol kop ma atir ikin jo Icrael ki jo Ammon tin.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Ento latel pa jo Ammon pe oketo cwinye ikom kwena ma Jeputa ocwalo bote.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Ci Cwiny pa Rwot obino ikom Jeputa, omiyo obaro dye Gilead ki Manace, okato kwede wa i Mijpa ma i lobo Gilead. Ki kunu en dok okato kwede ikom jo Ammon. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Jeputa onongo okwongo kwong bot Rwot kun waco ni, “Ka ibimiyo jo Ammon i cinga, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />ci ngat ma bikati woko ki i dogola oda ma bibino karwate kweda ma adwogo madong aloyo jo Ammon, en aye bibedo pa Rwot ci abimiye me bedo gitum awanga.” <verse eid="JDG 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Kitmeno Jeputa ongolo loka kulu ikom jo Ammon kalweny kwedgi, ci Rwot omiyogi i cinge. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Ci en onekogi cake ki i Aroer nio kwede wa i lobo macok ki Minit, taun pyere aryo madito, ki nio wa i Abel-keramim, kun ginekogi matek tutwal. Kitmeno Lubanga omiyo jo Icrael guloyo jo Ammon.<verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nya pa Jeputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Ka Jeputa odwogo cen i pacone i Mijpa, ci nen, nyare okato woko karwate kwede ki ajaa ki myel. Nyare en acel keken, pe tye ki wode nyo nyare mo mukene. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 30:2">Wel 30:2</ref></char></note>Ka oneno nyare, ci oyeco bongone woko pi cwercwiny kun waco ni, “Maa do, nyara! Ituru teka woko do, iketa i cwar can madwong kuman, pien onongo dong atingo doga bot Rwot ma dong pe atwero loko kwonga.” <verse eid="JDG 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Ci nyare owaco boteni, “Wora, ka onongo itingo dogi bot Rwot, ci dong itima kit ma itingo ki dogini, pien Rwot dong oculu kwor ikom jo Ammon ma lumerokini.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Dok oloko ki wone, kun owace ni, “Kong itima man; wek abed pi dwe aryo, wek kong acit awire i kor godi, wek acit akok akum pi tidina, an kacel ki luwota, pien abito ma peya kinyoma.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />En ogamo doge ni, “Citi.” Ci ocwalo nyare pi dwe aryo. Nyako ocito, en ki luwote, ci gukok iwi godi kun gikumu pi tidine. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Ka dwe aryonu otum, odwogo cen bot wone, ci otime kit mayam okwongoni. Nyare yam pe obedo ki meye mo. Ci lok man dong odoko kit ki bot jo Icrael <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />ni anyira Icrael yam gicito kakumu pi nya pa Jeputa ma Lagilead nino angwen i mwaka acel acel iwi godi.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s1">Jeputa ki jo Epraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Jo Epraim guywayo mony, ikare ma gungolo loka, ci guwoto guo wa i Japon, ci guwaco bot Jeputa ni, “Pingo i cito kalweny ikom jo Ammon, kun bene pe imedo ki lwongowa wek wacit kwedi? Wabiwango wii woko i odi.” <verse eid="JDG 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Ci Jeputa ogamo doggi ni, “An ki lwaka yam wabedo ki mone madit ki jo Ammon, ento ka alwongowu, wun pe wutwero lara ki i cinggi. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Ka aneno ni pe wutwero lara, ci adyero koma angolo loka ca ikom jo Ammon, ci Rwot omiyogi i cinga. Pingo tin dok wubino bota kalweny ikoma?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Ci Jeputa ocoko jo Gilead ducu, ka en olwenyo ki jo Epraim, ci jo Gilead guloyo jo Epraim. Onongo ceng jo Epraim guwaco ni, “Wun jo Gilead ma wubedo ikin jo Epraim ki Manace, wun giwu jo Epraim aye mayam wuringo wularo komwu.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Ma omiyo jo Gilead gumako wang wat ducu me kulu Jordan pi gengo jo Epraim. Ka dano mo ikin jo Epraim ma oringo olaro kome owaco ni, “Wek angol akat loka ca,” ci jo Gilead giwaco bote ni, “In i jo Epraim?” Kace ogamo ni, “Pe,” <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />ci guwaco bote ni, “Kong i wac Sibolet,” ci en waco ni, “Cibolet,” pien pe twero lwongone ma atir maber; ci cut kimake, kineke woko iwang wat kunu. Ci jo Epraim guto maromo alip pyere angwen wiye aryo inino meno.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Jeputa obedo langolkop i lobo Icrael pi mwaka abicel. Ka Jeputa ma Lagilead oto woko, ci kiyike i gange ma i Gilead.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibijan, Elon, ki Abudon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Dano ma olube me bedo langolkop i Icrael obedo Ibijan, dano me Beterekem. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />En yam tye ki awobene pyere adek, ki anyira pyere adek. Ci en omiyo anyirane kinyomogi i kaka mukene, dok okelo anyira ma i kaka mukene pyere adek pi awobene. Ibijan obedo kangolo kop i Icrael pi mwaka abiro. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Ka Ibijan oto woko, ci kiyike i Beterekem.<verse eid="JDG 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Ci Elon Lajabulon dok olubu kore, obedo langolkop i Icrael. En obedo kangolo kop i Icrael pi mwaka apar. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Ka Elon Lajabulon oto, ci kiyike i Aijalon i lobo pa jo Jabulon.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Ki i ngeye dok Abudon wod pa Ilel ma Lapiraton aye obedo langolkop i Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Yam tye ki awobene pyere angwen ki likwaye pyere adek ma giwoto ki kanagi pyere abiro. Obedo kangolo kop i Icrael pi mwaka aboro. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Ka dok Abudon wod pa Ilel ma Lapiraton oto, ci kiyike i Piraton ma i lobo Epraim, i lobo godi pa jo Amalek.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s1">Kinywalo Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Jo Icrael dok gutimo gin manen marac iwang Rwot, ci Rwot omiyogi i cing jo Piliciti pi mwaka pyere angwen.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Yam tye laco mo i Jora ma i kaka pa jo Dan, nyinge Manoa. Dakone onongo lalur, ma pe tye ki latin mo. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />Lamalaika pa Rwot onen bot dakone, ci owaco bote ni, “Nen, in lalur ma i peke ki latini mo. Ento ibiyac, ci ibinywalo latin laco. <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Pimeno myero igwoke, pe imat kongo bwino nyo gin ma mero dano, dok pe icam gin mo ma keni; <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:1-5">Wel 6:1-5</ref></char></note>pien, nen ibiyac, ci ibinywalo latin ma laco. Pe lyedi bigudu wiye, pien bibedo ajula pa Lubanga cake ki ikare ma kinywale, dok en bicako laro jo Icrael ki i cing jo Piliciti.” <verse eid="JDG 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Dakonu ocito otito lok man bot cware ni, “Dano pa Lubanga obino bota kun wange nen calo wang lamalaika pa Lubanga; neno lik tutwal. Pe apenye kama oa iye, ki bene en pe otita nyinge. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Ento owaco bota ni, ‘Nen, ibiyac i nywalo latin laco; pimeno pe imat kongo bwino nyo gin ma mero dano, pien latin meno bibedo ajula pa Lubanga cake ki ikare ma kinywale nio kwede wa inino me tone.’”<verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Manoa olego Rwot kun waco ni, “Ai Rwot, alegi ba, wek dano pa Lubanga ma nene icwaloni odwog botwa, wek opwonywa ki gin ma myero watii ikom awobi ma koni kibinywaloni.” <verse eid="JDG 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Lubanga owinyo koko pa Manoa, ci lamalaika pa Lubanga obino bot dakone doki ma en obedo katic i poto; ento cware Manoa onongo pe tye kacel kwede. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Dako oringo oyotoyot, otito bot cware ni, “Dano ma nene onen bota ikare ca dok onen bota kombedi.” <verse eid="JDG 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Ci Manoa oa cut ocito kun lubu kor dakone. Ka obino bot danoni, ci owace ni, “In aye i dano mayam iloko ki dakoni?” Ci en ogamo ni, “An.” <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Ci Manoa owaco bote kuman ni, “Ka loki dong ocobe kakare, kit kwo pa awobini bibedo ningning, dok en bitiyo kit gin ango?” <verse eid="JDG 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />Lamalaika pa Rwot odok iye bot Manoa ni, “Gin ducu ma dong awaco bot dakoni en ogwoki. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Pe ocam gin mo ma oa ikom olok, pe omat kongo bwino nyo gin ma mero dano, pe ocam gin mo ma keni; wek en olub gin ducu mayam acike iye.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Manoa owaco bot lamalaika pa Rwot ni, “Wek kong wagali manok mo ba, pi yubu latin dyel mo piri.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />Ento lamalaika pa Rwot owaco bot Manoa ni, “Kadi bed igala, pe abicamo camwu. Ento ka ibiyubu gitum awanga, ci dong itum bot Rwot.” Onongo Manoa pe ngeyo ni meno obedo lamalaika pa Rwot. <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Ci Manoa openyo Lamalaika pa Rwot ni, “Nyingi anga, wek ka loki ocobe kakare wamiyi deyo?” <verse eid="JDG 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:29">Aca 32:29</ref></char></note>Lamalaika pa Rwot owace ni, “Pingo ipenyo nyinga? Nyinga obedo me aura tutwal.” <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Manoa otero latin dyel kacel ki gityer me moko kwon, ci otyero ikom pata got bot Rwot ma tiyo tice me aurani. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Ka leb mac olyel ocito malo tung polo ki iwi keno tyer meno, ci lamalaika pa Rwot oito malo i leb mac me keno tyeri kun Manoa ki dakone gineno; ci gupoto piny aryeba ic.<verse eid="JDG 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Lamalaika pa Rwot pe dok onen bot Manoa ki dakone tyen mukene, ma omiyo Manoa oniang ni en lamalaika pa Rwot. <verse eid="JDG 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Ci Manoa owaco bot dakone ni, “Wan wabito ada, pien waneno Lubanga.” <verse eid="JDG 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Ento dakone ogamo doge ni, “Ka onongo Rwot oyube me nekowa, kono pe ogamo gitum awangawa ki gityer me moko kwon ki i cingwa; dok kono pe onyutu botwa lok magi ducu, kadi tucu lok macalo magi.” <verse eid="JDG 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Ka dako onywalo wode, ci ocako nyinge Samson. Ci awobi meno odongo kun Rwot miye gum. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Cwiny pa Rwot ocako tic ikome wa ki i gony pa Dan ma ikin Jora ki Ecitaol kun loyo tame.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s1">Samson ki dako mo me Timna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Samson ocito Timna, ci ki kunu en oneno nyako mo ma anyira jo Piliciti. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Ka en dong odwogo cen i ganggi, ci en otito bot wone ki mine ni, “Aneno nyako mo ikin anyira jo Piliciti i Timna; ber wunyoma nyakonu wek obed dakona.” <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Ento wone ki mine guwaco bote ni, “Nyako mo pe ikin lwak anyira ma tuwu ce, nyo ikin rokwa ducu, en aye ma omiyo i cito kakelo dako ki ikin jo Piliciti ma pe gulireni?” Ento Samson ogamo dog woneni, “Ber wunyoma nyanu, pien mwonya tutwal.”<verse eid="JDG 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Wone ki mine onongo pe gungeyo ni loki oa ki bot Rwot; pien onongo en obiyenyo tyen alii mo ikom jo Piliciti. Ikare meno onongo jo Piliciti aye giloyo jo Icrael.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Ci Samson ocito Timna gin ki wone ki mine. Ka guwoto guo cok ki poti olok matye i Timna, ci nen latin labwor mo omor ikome. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />Cut Cwiny Rwot obino opoto ikome ki tek, ci oyeco kom labwor ma obaro iye woko macalo yeco latin dyel, kun en pe tye ki gin mo i cinge. Ento pe otito gin ma en otimoni bot wone nyo mine. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Ka ocito kunu, en oloko ki nyako ca, ci oyomo cwinye matek. <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Ka kare okato manok, ci en odok kunu kaomo dakone, ci en ongak ocito kaneno kom labwor ma enekoni. Ci nen, lwak kic odonyo ikom labwor, moo kic bene tye iye. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Samson ototo kic, yaka opyelo padane i dye cinge kun camo woto kwede. Ka oo kwede bot wone ki mine, ci omiyogi mogo, gin bene gucamo. Ento pe otito botgi ni etoto kic ki ikom labwor ma enekoni.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Lacen wone ocito bot dakonu, ci Samson otedo karama kunu, pien latin awobi yam timo kitmeno. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Ka jo kunu gunene, gukelo bote jo pyere adek wek gubed kwede. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samson owaco botgi ni, “Wek kong awac ki wun koc lit ba, ka wubigonyo tere ikin nino abironi me karama man, ma wunongo tyen loke, ci an abimiyo ki wun bongi camanini pyere adek, ki bongi mabeco pyere adek bene me aruka pi nino madito. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Ento ka waco tyen loke oloyowu, ci wun aye wubimina bongi camanini pyere adek, ki bongi mabeco pyere adek bene me aruka pi nino madito.” Ci guwace ni, “Wac koc litini, wek kong wawiny mono.” <verse eid="JDG 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Ci owaco botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">“Ii lacam dano oa iye cam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:14">Ii latekkom oa iye gin ma lim.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Ento gin gutyeko nino adek ma pe gitwero gonyo tyen koc lit meno.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Inino me angwene guwaco bot dako pa Samson ni, “Bit cwari, wek otit botwa tyen koc lite. Ka pe, ci wawangi woko ki mac wa ki jo me ot pa woru bene. Wun wulwongowa kany pi yako jamiwa woko bo?” <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Ci dako pa Samson ocako kok inyime kun waco bote ni, “In idaga giri, pe imara. Iwaco koc lit bot lutuwa kun bene pe itita te loke.” Ci Samson Ogamo doge ni, “Nen, yam pe atito bot wora wa maa bene, ci in aye dong abititi bo?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Dako obedo kakok bote pi nino abiro, kit ma karama obedo kwede; ci ikom nino me abirone otito bot dakone, pien onongo dong odiye matek. Dako ocito otito koc lit bot lutugi, <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />ma omiyo jo me gang meno guwace tyen koc lite ma peya ceng opoto ikom nino me abirone, kun giwaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Gin ango ma lim makato moo kic?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">Gin ango matek makato labwor?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">En owaco botgi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">“Kono yam pe wubedo kapur ki royana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 14:18">kono pe wugonyo tyen koc lita.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Ci Cwiny pa Rwot obino opoto ikome ki tek. Ci ocito i Acikelon, oneko dano pyere adek ma i gang meno, oyako jamigi, omiyo bongigi mabeco me aruka pi nino madito bot jo ma gugonyo koc liti, ci en odok i paco pa wone ki twon akemo madwong. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Ci kimiyo dako pa Samson woko bot lawote ma onongo obedo kangeteni ikare me nyom.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Ka kare okato manok, ikare ma kikayo iye ngano, Samson ocito kalimo dakone ki latin dyel mo i cinge, ci owaco bot jo gang pa dakonegi ni, “Abidonyo bot dakona i kicikane.” Ento won dako pe oye en odonyo. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Ci won dakone owaco bote ni, “Onongo atamo mera i ada ni ityeko kwere woko, ma omiyo dong amiye woko bot lawoti. Lamine matidini dok ber kato en. Ber ibed kwede me kakare.” <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Ento Samson owaco botgi ni, “Tin dong pe abibedo labal ka atimo gin marac ikom jo Piliciti.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Ci Samson ocito omako lwak too miya adek, ci oriyo raa. Oloko too omiyo yibgi okeme ki wadi, ci otweyo raa ikin yibgi ki aryo aryo. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Ka en ocwinyo mac ikom raa, ci oweko too gucito kwede i poto ngano pa Lupiliciti ma peya kikayogi. Mac owango wic larita ma kigurugi woko kacel, ki ngano ma peya kikayo, wa ki poti jeituni bene. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Ka Lupiliciti gupenyo ni, “Man anga ma otimo?” Ci guwaco ni, “Samson ma cwar dako me Latimna aye otimo, pien gukwanyo dakone, gumiyo woko bot lawote.” Ma omiyo jo Piliciti gubino, guwango anyaka ki wone woko ki mac. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Ci Samson owaco botgi ni, “Kace wutimo kitmeno, ci akwongo akwonga botwu ni abiculu kwor ikomwu, ka dong abiweko lobo bedo mot.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Ci Samson ocako datogi ki tong, onekogi matek; lacen ocito obedo i boro got ma i Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samson oloyo jo Piliciti i Leki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Jo Piliciti gubino, gugony i Juda, ci gumonyo Leki. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Jo Juda guwaco botgi ni, “Pingo wun wubino kamonyowa?” Ci gugamo doggi ni, “Wabino katweyo Samson, wek watim en kit ma en otimowa kwedeni.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Jo Juda alip adek gucito i boro got ma i Etam, ka guwaco bot Samson ni, “In pe i ngeyoni jo Piliciti aye gitye kaloyowa ce? Ci itimowa kuman mono pi gin ango?” Ci Samson ogamo doggi ni, “Kit ma gutimo ikomani, an bene atimogi kumeno.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Ka dok guwace ni, “Wan wabino katweyo in, wek wamii in i cing jo Piliciti.” Ci Samson owaco botgi ni, “Kong wukwonge bota ki kwong ni pe wun aye wubineka wun kikomwu.” <verse eid="JDG 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Ci gugamo ni, “Pe gire; wan wabitweyi atweya keken, ci wabimiyo in i cinggi.” Ci gutweye ki tol aryo manyen, gukele woko ki i boro got ma i Etam.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Ka guo o i Leki, Lupiliciti gubino karomo kwede kun gidange ki yomcwiny me loc, ci Cwiny pa Rwot obino opoto ikome ki tek, ka ocodo tol ma kitweyo ki cinge. Tol ocod calo tol obira ma mac owango. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Samson ocob ikom cogo cwak kana mo manyen, ikare ma owoto cinge, ka okwanyo cogo meno, ci oneko kwede dano alip acel kulu. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Ci Samson owaco ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">“Pi cogo cwak kana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">dano odure kom wadi lipimpim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">ki cogo cwak kana</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JDG 15:16">aneko kwede co alip.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Ka otyeko loko loke ducu, obolo cogo cwak kana ma i cingeni piny, ci kicako nying kabedonu ni, Ramat-leki.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="fk">Ramat-leki </char> te loke “Got me cogo cwak kana.”</note><verse eid="JDG 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Lacen orwo pii oneko Samson matek, ci okok bot Rwot kun waco ni, “ityeko larowa matek kit man ki cinga, Rwot, ci dok iweko ato woko kombedi ki orwo pii? Dong apot i cing jo ma pe kilirogi bo?” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Ci Lubanga obaro wang got matwolo mayam tye i Leki, ci pii onyete ki iye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 15:19">Ka omato, ci kerone ki cwinye odwogo, olimo tek doki. Pieno nying kabedonu kilwongo ni, En-akore; pud tye i Leki wa onyo.<verse eid="JDG 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Samson obedo langolkop i Icrael ikare me ayelayela pa jo Piliciti pi mwaka maromo pyere aryo.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s1">Samson ocito Gaja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Inino mo acel Samson ocito Gaja, ci oneno lakwele mo, ocito odonyo bote. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Ci kitito pire bot jo Gaja ni, “Samson obino kany,” ci gurumu kabedonu woko, gubutu gukure i dogcel me taun meno i dyewor benebene. Guling woko litik i dyewor meno, kun gikwilo lok ni, “Wek wakure nio wa kwar piny, ka dong wabineke.” <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Ento ka Samson obutu kunu oo wa i cwiny dyewor kikome, ci en oa malo i cwiny dyewor, ka omako dogcel me taun madit meno, ki pagi wire aryo ducu, ci oputugi woko liwuc, ka otingogi ki pal gwoke, ki rii me cegone ki jamine ducu, kun en woto kwede, ka oterogi wa iwi got ma inyim Kebron.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samson ki Delila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Lacen Samson dok omaro dako mo ma i nota me Corek, ma nyinge Delila. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Ci rwodi pa jo Piliciti gubino bot dakonu, ci guwaco bote ni, “Bit en mot, wek inong kama tek kome madwongi ocung iye, ki dong wabiloye ikit yo ango, wek watweye, wabwoye; ci wan ki acel acel wabimini lim ryal alip acel ki miya acel.” <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Ci Delila ocako waco bot Samson ni, “In pwoyo itita kama tek komi madwongi ocung iye do, ki kit ma myero kitweyi kwede, wek kibwoyi?” <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samson owaco bote ni, “Kace kitweya ki tol atum abiro, manyene, ma pe otwo, ci abidoko goro macalo dano mukene ducu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Rwodi pa Lupiliciti gukelo tol atum manyen abiro ma peya otwone, ci Delila otweyo ki Samson woko. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Dakonu onongo tye ki co ma gukane i kicika matye i tyelo. Ci owaco bot Samson ni, “Samson, Lupiliciti gubino ikomi!” Ento en ocodo tol atum woko ducu, macalo tol tworo ma ogudu mac. Kitmeno kama tek kome ocung iye pe omedo ki ngene.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Ci Delila owaco bot Samson ni, “Nen ka ibwola ba, ci iloka giri adoko lalok goba. In pwoyo itita kit ma myero kitweyi kwede.” <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Ci dok owaco bote ni, “Kace kitweya ki tol ma peya kitiyo kwedgi, ci abidoko goro macalo dano mukene ducu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Delila okwanyo tol manyen, otweye kwede, ci owace ni “Samson, Lupiliciti gibino ikomi!” Delila onongo bene omiyo dano mukene gukane i kicika ma i tyelo. Ento Samson ocodo tol woko ki i cinge macalo uci me kwoyo bongo.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Ka Delila dok owaco bot Samson ni “Pud ibwola aye oo wa onyo, kun iloka lok goba. Tita kit ma myero kitweyi kwede mono.” Ci owace ni, “Kace imako dog yer wiya abiro, ma icweyo ci irwako i bongo ma itye kacweyoni, ci irido ki yat lacwe bongo dok ka irido ikin uci ma irwako wek omok matek, ci abidoko goro macalo dano mukene ducu.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Kitmeno ka dong Samson onino, ci Delila omako dog yer wiye abiro, ocweyo kun orwako i bongo ma en tye kacweyoni, ci orido ki yat wek omok iye matek. Ci owace ni, “Samson, Lupiliciti gubino ikomi!” Ento en oco ki iwang nino owoto yat, oputu kwede yat me cweyo bongo, ki bongo ma ikome ma kitye kacweyoneni.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Lacen dako owaco bote ni, “Itwero waco ningning ni imara kun nongo pe igena ki cwinyi ducu? Man dong ibwola tyen me adeke, kun pe itita kama tek komi madwongi ocung iye.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Ka dako obedo kadide matek ki lok nino ki nino, kun loko bote ki tek, omiyo cwinye obale woko mamito ni etoo woko. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Ci dong otito bot dakone gin ducu matye i cwinye, kun wace bene ni, “Lyedi peya ogudu yer wiya, pien abedo ajula pa Rwot cake wa ki ikare ma kinywala iye. Kace kilyelo yer wiya, ci tek koma biweka woko, abidoko goro, abibedo macalo dano mukene ducu.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Ka Delila oneno ni dong en otyeko tite lok ducu ma i cwinye, ci ocwalo kwena olwongo rwodi pa jo Piliciti kun waco ni, “Wubin kong dong wunu tyen aceli keken, pien dong otita lok ma i cwinye ducu.” Rwodi pa jo Piliciti gubino kun gikele ki lim bene i cinggi. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Ci Delila omiyo Samson onino woko i eme, ka olwongo laco mo wek obin olyel tutunu me yer wiye abironi woko. Ci dakonu ocako time malitlit, ci teko kome oa woko ki ikome. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Ka dako owaco ni, “Samson, Lupiliciti gubino ikomi!” Ci Samson oco woko ki iwang nino kun tamo ni, “Abikato woko kit macon ca, ci atengogi woko ki ikoma.” Onongo en pe ongeyo ni tek pa Rwot dong otyeko a woko ki ikome. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Ka Lupiliciti gumake, ci gukolo wange woko, gutere wa i Gaja. Ci gutweye ki atego mola, kama obedo karego bel iye ki i buc. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Ento yer wiye ocako lot ki inge lyelone.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">To pa Samson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Ka kare okato malac inge mako Samson, rwodi pa Lupiliciti gucoke katyero gitum madwong bot Dagon ma lubangagi ma cwinygi yom adada, pien gubedo kawaco ni, “Lubangawa dong omiyo lamerokwa Samson i cingwa.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Ka lwak gunene, gupako lubangagini kun giwaco ni, “lubangawa dong omiyo lamerokwa i cingwa ma lanek pinywa, ma ceng otyeko lwak jowa mapol.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Ka cwinygi dong yom, ci guwaco ni. “Kong kilwong Samson wek kong ogal wangwa.” Kitmeno kilwongo Samson ki i ot buc, ci obedo kagalo wanggi. Ci kiweko en obino ocung ikin wir ot aryo. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samson owaco bot awobi ma peyeni ni, “Wek kong abong kom wir ma ot man ocung iyeni, wek kong ajenge ikomgi.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Ot meno onongo opong ki co ki mon, ki rwodi abic ducu pa Lupiliciti onongo gitye kunu. Malo iwi ot bene onongo tye co ki mon alip adek ma gubedo kaneno Samson ka tye kagalo wanggi.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Ka dong Samson okok bot Rwot kun waco ni. “Ai Rwot Lubanga, po pira, alegi doki, imiya tek koma tin kiceli keken. Ai Lubanga alegi dong iwek acul kwor ikom jo Piliciti pi wanga aryoni lawangacel.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Ci Samson omako wir ot aryo ma idyere ma otti ocung ikomgini, otyele ki teke ducu, ojenge ikomgi, kun cinge ma lacuc omako wir acel, ki cinge ma lacam omako mukene. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Ka dong Samson owaco ni, “Wek dong ato kacel ki jo Piliciti.” Ci en okule ki teke ducu, omiyo ot opoto ikom rwodi ki ikom lwak ma gitye iyeni. Kitmeno, jo ma en onekogi ikare me tone obedo pol makato jo mayam onekogi ma pud en kwo. <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Omegine ki lukakagi ducu gubino, gutingo kome, gukelo lyele ci guyike ikin Jora ki Ecitaol, i lyel pa wone Manoa. Samson obedo langolkop i Icrael pi mwaka pyere aryo.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s1">Mika ki cal apayane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Yam tye dano mo i lobo godi me Epraim ma nyinge Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />En owaco bot mine ni, “Lim ryal alip apar wiye acel mayam kikwalo ki botini, mayam iceno iye danoni, kun an bene awinyo gire, nen, ryal meno tye bota, an aye yam akwanyo.” Mine ogamo ni. “Rwot omiyi gum, latina.” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Ka ocako dwoko lim ryal alip apar wiye acel bot mine, ci mine owaco ni, “An kikoma dong adyero ryal man bot Rwot pi woda me tiyo cal apaya ki nyonyo ryal man ma kiliyo aliya wek okwany acena ki ikom woda; ci kombedi dong amiyo boti.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Mika dok odwoko lim bot mine, ci mine okwanyo lim ryal miya aryo, omiyo bot latet ryal, en otiyo ki cal apaya ma kimwono kome ki ryal, ki cal ryal ma kiliyo aliya, ci kiketo i ot pa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Laco man Mika, onongo ceng tye ki ot woro Lubanga i gange, ci otiyo epod ki terapim,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="fk">Terapim </char> teloke ileb Ibru ni cal lubanga mukene. </note> ci oketo wode acel me bedo ajwakane. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6:</char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:25">Lung 21:25</ref> </char></note>Ikare meno onongo dano ma laloc peke i lobo Icrael; ci dano acel acel onongo gire tiyo gin ma en tamo ni tye atir.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Ikare meno onongo tye latin laco mo ma bedo wa i Beterekem, i lobo Juda. En onongo Lalevi ci en obedo kunu macalo welo. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />En odak oa woko ki i Beterekem ma i Juda wek ecit ebed i kabedo mo ma ebinongo. Ka owoto, ci oo wa i lobo godi me Epraim, i gang pa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Ci Mika openye ni, “In ia ki kwene?” En ogamo doge ni “An Lalevi me Beterekem ma i Juda, abibedo i kabedo mo ma koni abinongone.” <verse eid="JDG 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Ci Mika owaco bote ni, “Bed dong bota, wek ibed wora ki ajwakana, ci abimini litin lim mo me ryal apar mwaka ki mwaka, ki bongi me arukani, ka dok abigwoki.” <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Lalevini oye bedo bote; ci latin laco meno ocako bedo kwede macalo ngat acel ikom lutinone. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Mika oketo Lalevi meno obedo ajwakane, ci en obedo i gang pa Mika. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />I karenu Mika owaco ni, “Kombedi dong angeyo ni Rwot dong bitima jami mabeco, pien dong atye ki Lalevi me bedo ajwakana.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mika ki jo Dan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Ikare meno onongo dano ma laloc maber mo peke i Icrael. Dok ikare meno jo ma i kaka pa Dan gin gubedo kayenyo kabedo mo me bedo ginaleyagi, wek gibed iye, pien onongo peya gin gunongo dul lobo mo me aleya ikin kaka me Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Kitmeno jo Dan gucwalo dano abic makwiri ki ikin ludogolagi ducu, ci gua ki i Jora ki Ecitaol pi roto lobo ki ngiyone maber, kun kiwaco botgi ni, “Wucit wungi lobone maber.” Ci gubino wa i lobo godi me Epraim, i gang pa Mika, ci gubutu kunu. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Ka pud onongo gitye i gang pa Mika, ci gungeyo dwon Lalevi matidini, ci gungak gucito wa bote, gupenye ni, “Anga mono ma okeli wa kany? Itye katimo ango i kabedo man? Ibedo kany pingo mono?” <verse eid="JDG 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Ci en owaco botgi ni, “Mika aye obedo katima kuman, pien wayubu lok kwede; dok en aye bene cula gire, ci dong adoko ajwakane.” <verse eid="JDG 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Ci gulege ni, “Kong ipeny dog Lubanga i yo wotwa man, wek wange ka wotwa ma wacito iyeni bibedo maber.” <verse eid="JDG 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Ci Ajwaka owaco botgi ni, “Wucit ki kuc. Rwot Lubanga aye obigwokowu i wotwu man ma wucito iyeni pien wang Lubanga tye oketo ikomwu pi timowu maber.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Ci jo abici gucito guo wa i Laic, ci guneno jo ma gitye kenyu, ki kit ma gibedo kwede mot ikit marom ki bedo pa jo Cidon, ma gibedo mot kun nongo gutoyo tokgi ata, dok ni pe gin mo orem ki botgi iwi lobo, ento gitye gigi ki lonyo madwong. Dok onongo gitye kamabor ki bot jo Cidon, dok pe bene gimer ki ngat mo. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Ka gudwogo bot omegigi i Jora ki Ecitaol, omegigi gupenyogi ni, “Wukelo ki wan kit lok ango?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Gugamo doggi ni, “Wua, wek wacitu ikomgi, pien waneno lobo ca, lobone ber tutwal. Pe wumito timo iye gin mo? Pe wugale kacito kunu kadonyo iye, ki kacamo lobone woko. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Ka wubicito kunu, ci wubituc ikom jo ma gutoyo tokgi ata. Lobone lac; ada Lubanga otyeko miyone woko i cingwu, kabedone tye iye gin ducu mamite iwi lobo.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Ci jo miya abicel ma i kaka pa Dan gukwanyo jami lwenygi, gua ki i Jora ki Ecitaol, <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />gukato, gugony i Kiriat-jearim i Juda. Pi lok meno omiyo kabedonu kilwongo ni Gony pa Dan o wa onyo. Nen, tye inget Kiriat-jearim, tung kupotoceng. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Lacen gukato gucito wa i lobo godi me Epraim, ci gubino wa i gang pa Mika.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Ka dong jo abic meno mayam onongo gucito karoto lobo Laic guwaco bot omegigi ni, “Wungeyo mono ni i odi kany tye iye epod, terapim, cal apaya ki cal me ryal ma kiliyo aliya? Kombedi dong wutam gin ma wubitimo.” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Ci gungak gucito kunu, guwoto guo i ot pa latin Lalevi ma i paco pa Mika, ci gupenye ka en tye maber. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Jo Dan miya abicel ma gumako jami lwenygi i cinggi, gucung kwede i dog gang kama kidonyo ki iyeni, <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />ci jo abic ca mayam gucito karoto loboni gucito gudonyo wa i ot, ka gucako kwanyo cal apaya ki epod, terapim, ki cal me ryal ma kiliyo aliya, ma kun nongo ajwaka ocung i dog gang kacel ki jo miya abicel ma gumako jami lwenygi i cinggi. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Ka jonu gudonyo i ot pa Mika, gukwanyo cal apaya, ki epod, ki terapim, ki cal me ryal ma kiliyo aliya, ci ajwaka openyogi ni, “Wutimo gin ango mono?” <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Gin gugamo doge ni, “Ling litik mot, mii dogi woko ki cingi, ci ia ibin kacel kwedwa, wek icit ibed wonwa ki ajwakawa. Itamo ni bedo ber ka ibedo ajwaka i ot pa dano acel, nyo ibedo ajwaka i dogola nyo i kaka kulu ma i Icrael?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Cwiny ajwaka obedo yom ka owinyo man ci otero epod ki terapim, ki cal apaya, ci owoto kwedgi i dye lwak.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Kitmeno guloke gucako wot, kun gicwalo lutino ki lim makwo ki jamigi ducu inyimgi. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Ka dong gucito ma onongo gukato mabor ki i dog paco pa Mika, ci nen jo ma gibedo i gang macok ki gang pa Mika guringo gubino pi oduru pa Mika me oto lweny ikom jo Dan, ci gumako jo Dan i yo ma pud gitye bor kwedgi. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Ka dok gudange bot jo Dan, ci gin guloke, guwaco bot Mika ni, “Ango ma otimi ma omiyo ibino ki lwaki macalo man?” <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />En ogamo doggi ni, “Wukwanyo lubangana ma apayo, ki ajwakana, wucito kwede woko, dong adong ki gin ango? Ka dok wupenya akaka ni, ‘Ango ma otimi?’” <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Ento jo Dan gugamo ni, “Pe iwek dwoni owinye ikinwa, miyo kiniga mako jowa ci gipoto ikomwu, gineki ki jo ma i paconi ducu.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Ci jo Dan gucito gigi woko. Ka Mika oneno ni gitek ma pe eromo loyogi, en bene owire odok i pacone.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Ka jo Dan gutero jami mayam Mika opayo; ki ajwakane mayam tiyo bote, guo kwede wa i Laic, bot jo ma gubedo mot ma gutoyo tokgi ata, guwayo wer akero ikom jo Laic ka gunekogi ki pala lucwan, guwango taun gi woko ki mac. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Dano mo pe ma oringo oduru kalarogi, pien onongo gitye bor ki Cidon, dok yam pe gimer ki ngat mo. Onongo gitye i nota macok ki Bet Rekob. Jo Dan gugero taun meno odoco, ci gubedo iye. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Ci gucako nying taun meno ni, Dan, macalo nying Dan ma kwarogi, mayam Icrael onywalo. Ento yam con nying taun meno kilwongo ni Laic. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Jo Dan gucibo cal ma guteroni me aworagi. Ci Yonacan lakwar Gercom ma wod pa Moses, ki likwaye, gubedo ajwaki i kaka pa Dan o wa ikare ma kitero jo Icrael i opii. <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Cal mayam Mika opayo obedo kunu pi kare ducu ma Ot pa Lubanga obedo i Cilo.<verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s1">Lalevi mo ki dako angecane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Ikare meno onongo rwot mo pud pe maloyo lobo Icrael, dok ikare meno en aye yam onongo tye iye Lalevi mo ma obedo i lobo godi me Epraim macalo welo, ibut kabedo mo matye ki i tenge i lum kamabor. Lalevi ni ceng okwanyo nya jo Beterekem ma i Juda me bedo dako angecane. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Ka dakone ocako butu ki co mukene ci loke okelo keco ikin gi, omiyo dako man oa woko ki bote, ci odok i ot pa wone i Beterekem ma i Juda, ci obedo kunu pi dwe maromo angwen. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Lacen cware oa ocito kalubu kore kunu, wek elok kwede mot, ka oye wek edwog kwede gange. En owoto ki latice ki kana aryo, ci obino i ot pa won nyako. Ka won nyako onene, ci obino kajole ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Ci won dakone odiye, omiyo en obedo kunu pi nino adek kulu; gubedo kacamo cam ki mat, kun en butu kunu. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Inino me angwene gua malo con me cako wotgi, ci ka en dong oyube pi wot; ento won nyako dok owaco bot cwar nyare ni, “Kong igal dogi ki latin kwon mo, ka lacen dong wuwoti.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Jo aryonu gubedo gucamo ki mat kacel, ci won nyako owaco bot laconu ni, “Ber dok ibut kany tin, wek kong cwinyi opye mot.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Ka laconu oa malo me wot, won nyako dok ojuke, omiyo en dok obutu kunu. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Ka nino me abice oromo en dok oa malo odiko con me cako wote; ci won nyako dok owaco ni, “Kong igal dogi ki gin mo; dong kong ibed nio ka piny okwe.” Kitmeno gin aryonu ducu gubedo dok gucamo cam. <verse eid="JDG 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Lacen laconu ki dakone ki latice gua malo me cako wot. Ento won dakone dok owaco bote ni, “Nen, piny dong oyutu woko ayuta, bedo ber ka wubutu kany do. Nen piny dong oyutu woko, wubut kany wek kong cwinyi opye mot, ci diki wubia con i odiko, wek wucak wot me cito paco.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Ento laconu pe dok oye butu kunu. Ci en oa woko, ocako wote me cito wa i taun madit me Jebuc, ma en aye Jerucalem. Laconu onongo tye ki kana aryo ma dong kitweyo kom me bedo iwigi, ci en obedo kacel ki dakone. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Ka dong gitye cok ki Jebuc, onongo piny cok yutu woko, ci latice owaco bote ni, “Wek wangak i taun man madit pa jo Jebuc, ci wacit wabut kunu tin.” <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Ento rwode ogamo doge ni, “Pe wabitwero dok wire me cito bot lurok ma pe gin jo Icrael; ento wabikato akata ki i taun madit meno wek wacit i Gibea.” <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Ci en owaco bot latice ni, “Bin wek wacit i kabedo mo mukene, wabut i Gibea nyo i Rama.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Ci gukato gucito gigi, ci ceng opoto woko ma gitye cok ki Gibea, ma taun madit pa jo Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Ci gungak kunu pi butu i Gibea. Ka gudonyo iye, Lalevi ocito obedo piny i dye taun madit kamaleng; ento dano mo pe oterogi i ode wek gubut bote.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Ka lacen dano mo ma otii obino kun oa ki katic i potone. Danoni tuggi tye i lobo godi me Epraim; onongo en labedo i Gibea, ento wegi taun madit meno kikome gin jo Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Otingo wange ci oneno dano ca ma lawoti ma obedo i dye gang kamaleng, ci openye ni, “Icito kwene? Ia ki kwene?” <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Lalevi ogamo ni, “Waa ki i Beterekem ma i Juda, wadok i lobo godi me Epraim i kabedo mo i gang matye kamabor en aye gang kama wabedo iye. Onongo acito i Beterekem ma i Judani, kombedi abidok i gang; ento ngat mo pe oterowa i ode. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Watye ki reng kal ki cam pa kanawa, wa ki mugati ki kongo bwino ma romowa, an ki angecana ki awobini ma konyowa; gin mo ma orem peke.” <verse eid="JDG 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Ci dano ma otiini ogamo doge ni, “Kuc obed ikomi; abicobo gin ma wumitoni ducu; ento pe wubut woko i dye taun madit man aye.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Kitmeno ocako tero en i ot, ci omiyo cam ki kana. Ci gin gulwoko tyen gi, ka gucamo, ka gumato bene.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 19:5-8">Aca 19:5-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ka gitye kayomo cwinygi, ci nen, jo ma i taun madit meno ma lutim aranyi gurumu ot woko, gugoyo dogola kun giwaco bot ladit ma won ot meno ni, “Keliwa dano ma obino i odini woko, wek wabut kwede.” <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Won ot okato woko, ocito botgi, kun waco botgi ni, “Pe kumeno, utmega, pe wutim tim marac kitmeno; pien laco man dong odonyo i oda, pe wutim tim man me aranyi. <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Nen ba, nyara tye ene ma peya ongeyo laco, ki angeca pa laconi bene tye. Wek akelgi woko botwu kombedi, ci wuronygi kun wutimogi kit ma wumito; ento ikom laco man aye pe wutim aranyi mo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Ento jonu pe gumedo ki winyone, ma omiyo Lalevi omako dakone ci ocwale woko i cinggi. Gubutu kwede tektek, kit ma igi mito i dyewor benebene nio wa odiko, ci guweke ka piny dong mito ruu. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Ka te piny dong oyabe, dakonu obino opoto piny i dogola ot pa laco ma rwode tye boteni, nio ka piny odoko leng.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Ci rwode oa malo ki i odiko, oyabo dogola, okato woko pi mede ki wote. Ci nen, dako tye obutu i dogola me ot, kun cinge tye i dogola. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Laconu owaco bot dakone ni, “A malo wek waciti,” ento pe ogamo doge. Ci otingo kom dakone ma oto oketo iwi kanane; lacen oa ocito kwede wa i gange. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 11:7">1 Cam 11:7</ref></char></note>Ka dong odonyo i ode, okwanyo pala, omako kom dakone ma otoni, ci ongido woko i dul maromo apar wiye aryo, ka dok ocwalo i lobo pa jo Icrael ducu. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Jo ducu ma guneno guwaco ni, “Gin macalo man yam peya otime, bene peya yam onen, cake ikare mayam jo Icrael gua ki i Ejipt, nio wa onyo; kong wutam, wupor loke, ci wulok i iye.”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s1">Lweny ikom jo Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Ci jo Icrael ducu gukati woko, cake wa i Dan o kwede i Beer-ceba, medo ki lobo Gilead bene, ci lwak gucoke gubino inyim Rwot i Mijpa ki cwiny acel. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Rwodi pa lwak ducu ma i kaka pa jo Icrael gubino ci gucung i dye lwak pa Lubanga ma gucoke, co alip miya angwen ma gilwenyo ki pala lucwan, ki ma giwoto ki tyen gi. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Ci jo Benjamin bene guwinyo ni jo Icrael mukeneni gucito i Mijpa, ento jo Benjamin aye pe gubedo tye kunu. Ci jo Icrael guwaco bot lalevi ma cwar dakonu ni, “Tit ki wan kit ma tim aranyi man otime kwede.” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Ci lalevi ma cwar dako ma kinekoni owaco ni, “Inino mo acito i Gibea pa jo Benjamin, ma an aa ki dakona, ci ka piny tye kayutu watamo ni katwere wek abut iye. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Ci co me Gibea gubino ikoma, gurumu ot ma atye iyeni i dyewor meno kun gimito neka woko; ci gubutu tektek ki dakona dyewor benebene nio ka omedo ki to woko. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Atero dakona ma otoni wa i pacona ka angido kome woko, wek acwal dul kome orom lobo ducu ma jo Icrael guleyo odoko meggi; pien kitimo tim kipyeda ki me aranyi i Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Nenu ba, wun jo Icrael, wun ducu kong wupor loke ki kany, ka dong wumii tamwu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Ci lwak ducu gutware malo lawangacel lijur kun giwaco ni, “Wan ducu pe ngat acel mo bidok i kemane, kadi dano acel mo pe bidok bene i ode. <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Ento kombedi wabitimo jo Gibea kit man: wabicito ikomgi ki mony magwar kun kikwanyo lwak dano ki kwir me ero lweny. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Dok bene wabikwanyo dano apar ikom jo miya ki ikom kaka ducu ma i Icrael, ki dano miya acel ikom jo alip, ki dano alip ikom jo alip apar, wek gukel cam pi lwak, wek gubin gucul kwor ikom Gibea pa jo Benjamin pi bal aranyi ma gutimo i Icrael.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Kitmeno jo Icrael ducu gucoke kalweny ikom taun meno, ma guribe ki cwiny acel.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Ci kaka ducu ma i Icrael gucwalo jo mogo i dye kaka pa Benjamin ducu kun giwaco ni, “Kit tim aranyi ango ma otime ikinwuni? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Kombedi dong wumii jo meno i cingwa, lutim aranyi ma i Gibea, wek wanekgi woko, wajwergi ki pala lucwan gin jo maracuni woko ki Icrael.” Ento jo Benjamin pe gumedo ki winyo dog utmegigi jo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Ci jo Benjamin gua ki i taun gi, gucoke i Gibea me cito kalweny ikom jo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Inino meno ka jo Benjamin gukwano jo ma oa ki i taun gi, guromo jo alip pyere aryo wiye abicel ma gilwenyo ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Ikin jo meno ducu onongo tye co miya abiro ma kiyerogi ma gin cinggi lacam; ngat acel acel ikin gi bayo lagweng celo yer wic cut, ma pe bayo piny. <verse eid="JDG 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Jo Icrael ducu ma pe kikwano iye jo Benjamin guromo co alip miya angwen ma gilwenyo ki pala lucwan; gin gubedo jo ma onongo gin jo ma gupwonye ki diro me lweny.<verse eid="JDG 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Jo Icrael gua gucito i Betel, ci gupenyo dog Lubanga ni, “Anga ki ikinwa ma bikwongo cito kalweny ikom jo Benjamin?” Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Jo Juda aye gibikwongo cito.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Ci jo Icrael gua odiko con me cito kunu, ci gugony cok ma kun gikemo Gibea. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Gucito kalweny ikom jo Benjamin, kun guryeyo jo gi ki tyeng inyim Gibea me lweny ikomgi. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Jo Benjamin gukati woko ki i Gibea, ci guneko jo Icrael maromo jo alip pyere aryo wiye aryo inino meno. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22-23" />Ci jo Icrael gucito, gukok matek inyim Rwot nio wa otyeno. Ka dok gupenyo dog Rwot ni, “Wan dok wacit kalweny ikom utmegiwa, jo Benjamin?” Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Wun wucit, wek wulweny ikomgi.” Man omiyo jo Icrael gucamo co, ci dok guryeyo jo gi ki tyeng i kabedo ma onongo guryeyo iye inino mukwongoni.<verse eid="JDG 20:22-23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Kitmeno jo Icrael gurwayo cok ikom jo Benjamin inino me aryone. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Jo Benjamin dok gukati woko ki i Gibea inino me aryone, ci guneko jo alip apar wiye aboro ki ikin jo Icrael; gin ducu gubedo jo ma lulweny ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Ci jo Icrael dok gua gucito wa i Betel ki monygi ducu, ka guo kunu gukok matek; ci gubedo piny lirim inyim Rwot, kun bene gurii kec inino meno oo wa otyeno. Gutumu bene gitum awanga ki gityer me nywako inyim Rwot. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Ka meno otum dok jo Icrael gupenyo dog Rwot, pien Canduk Me Gicike pa Lubanga onongo tye kunu ikare meno, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />kun Finekaci wod pa Eleajar ma wod pa Aron aye tiyo inyime ikare meno. Gupenyo dog Rwot ni, “Pud dok wacit kalweny ikom utmegiwa jo Benjamin aye, nyo wawek lweny dong ogik woko?” Ci Rwot owaco ni, “Wucit, pien diki abimiyogi i cingwu.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Kitmeno jo Icrael guketo dano ma obutu gurumu Gibea woko. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Ci jo Icrael gucito kalweny ikom jo Benjamin inino me adeke, Ci guywayo mony ikom jo Gibea kit mayam ca. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Ci jo Benjamin gukati woko ikom jo Icrael, ci gumol gucito woko wa inge gang. Gucako neko jo Icrael kit mayam ca ki i gudu, i yoo me cito Betel ki i yoo mukene bene ma cito Gibea, wa ki i bar bene, dano mamito romo ka pyere adek. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Ma omiyo jo Benjamin guwaco ni, “Gutware guringo woko ki i nyimwa kit mayam ca.” Ento jo Icrael onongo guwaco ni, “Wek kong waring woko, wek waywagi woko ki i gang o wa i gudu.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Ci jo Icrael ducu dong gutware woko ki i kabedogi, gurye i yoo pi lweny wa i Baal-tamar; ki jo Icrael mayam gubutu gukane kakurugi inget Gibea tung kupotoceng gutware woko ducu ki i kabedogi. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Jo alip apar ma kiyerogi ki ikin jo Icrael ducu gubino ikom Gibea, ci lwenye odoko tek; ento jo Benjamin pe gungeyo ni to pacogi dong onyiko botgi cok. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Ci Rwot omiyo jo Icrael guloyo jo Benjamin; ci jo Icrael gujwero jo Benjamin maromo alip pyere aryo wiye abic ki miya acel inino meno, gin ducu jo ma lulweny ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JDG 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Pieno jo Benjamin guneno ni dong guloyogi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 20:36">Jo Icrael gujer, guweko kabedo ki jo Benjamin, pien gigeno jo ma kiketo gubutu inget Gibeani. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Ci jo ma gubutu kakurugini gurune ci gucore o ikom Gibea, guneko jo ducu ma i taun madit meno woko ki pala lucwan. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Onongo jo Icrael ki jo ma obutu gurumu taun madit guyubu lanyut ni, ka dong kimiyo yito mac oduny ocito malo ki i taun madit, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />ci jo Icrael myero gudwog cen kalweny ikom lubenjamin. Jo Benjamin onongo gucako lweny ci kineko jo Icrael pyere adek kun giwaco ni, “Ada, watye kaloyogi macalo i lweny mukwongo ca.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Ento ka lanyut ocako duny ki i taun madit, yito mac ma ocung macalo wir, jo Benjamin guneno yo ngegi; ci nen, taun madit dong ducu tye kawang duny malo o wa i polo. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Ci jo Icrael guloke, gudwogo cen kalweny ikom jo Benjamin, omiyo kom jo Benjamin obange woko, pien guneno ni to pacogi dong onyiko cok. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Pimeno guloko ngegi guringo woko ki bot jo Icrael kun gidok i yo tung tim ata. Ento lweny ongukogi woko, ka dok jo Icrael gumol gukati woko ki i taun madit ci gutyeko jo Benjamin woko ki pala lucwan.<verse eid="JDG 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Gujwero jo Benjamin woko, kun guryemo korgi ci guradogi woko piny labongo yweyo o kwede wa tung kama okemo Gibea tung kunyangone. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Ci jo Benjamin maromo alip apar wiye aboro guto woko, gin ducu oteka lweny. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Ka dong odoko rac, ci jo mukene ikin gi guloke guringo tung i tim ata o wa i got Rimmon; dok kineko jo alip abic ki ikomgi ma kitongogi kireto woko piny i gudu. Ci guryemo korgi matek nio wa Gidom, ci guneko jo alip aryo mukene ki kunu bene. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Jo Benjamin ducu ma kineko ma orade piny inino meno guromo alip pyere aryo wiye abic ma lulweny ki pala lucwan; gin ducu oteka lweny. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Ento jo miya abicel guloko ngegi ci guringo gularo yoo ma cito tung tim wa i got Rimmon, gubedo i got kunu i Rimmon pi dwe angwen. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Jo Icrael dok gudwogo cen kalweny ikom jo Benjamin, gunekogi ki pala lucwan, dano ki lee ki gin ducu ma gunongo. Ci guwango taun ducu ma gunongo.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s1">Kinongo mon pi jo Benjamin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Onongo jo Icrael yam gukwongo kwong i Mijpa ni, “Pe dano mo ki ikinwa bimiyo nyare me anyoma bot jo Benjamin.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Ci lwak gubino i Betel, gubedo kunu inyim Lubanga o wa otyeno, ci gukok bot Rwot matek <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />kun giwaco ni, “Ai Rwot Lubanga pa Icrael, pingo lok man otime i Icrael, ma tin dong wi kaka acel odong manok mo keken i Icrael?” <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Ka dok orwone lwak gua odiko con kacano keno tyer kunu, me tyero gitum awanga ki gityer me berbedo. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Ci jo Icrael guwaco ni, “Ikin kaka me Icrael ducu jo mene mayam pe gubino ikare ma wacoke kwede bot Rwot?” Pien onongo gukwongo kwong madit ni, “Ka dano mo pe obino bot Rwot i Mijpa kibineke woko.” <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Kica omako jo Icrael ikom utmegigi jo Benjamin kun giwaco ni, “Kaka acel dong wange tye karwenyo woko tin ki ikin jo Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Wabitimo ningning pi nongo mon pi jo gi ma gudong. Ma dong watyeko kwongo kwong i nying Rwot ni pe wabimiyo anyirawa mo botgi me anyomani?”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Ma omiyo guwaco ni, “Jo mene ma gitye ikin kaka me Icrael mayam pe gubino bot Rwot i Mijpa?” Ci gunongo ni ikare ma dano gucoke i Mijpa pe dano mo acel obino i gony ma oa ki i Jabec Gilead. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Pien ikare ma kikwano dano ducu, dano acel mo pe onen ma oa ki bot jo ma bedo i Jabec Gilead. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Pieno lwak gucwalo twoni co ma lulweny alip apar wiye aryo kun gicikogi ni, “Wucit wunek jo ma bedo i Jabec Gilead ki pala lucwan, wa mon ki lutino. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />Wubitimogi kit man; co ducu ki mon ducu mayam gubutu ki co wubijwerogi woko liweng.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Ikin jo me Jabec Gilead gunongo anyira miya angwen ma peya gubutu ki co, ci gukelogi i gony ma i Cilo, matye i lobo Kanaan.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Ka dong lwak ducu gucwalo lok bot jo Benjamin ma gitye i got Rimmon kun giloko botgi lok me kuc. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Jo Benjamin ma gudwogo ikare meno kimiyo botgi anyira me Jabec Gilead ma kiwekogi makwoni; ento pe guromogi ducu. <verse eid="JDG 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Kica omako lwak ikom jo Benjamin, pien onongo Rwot oketo ariya ikom kaka me Icrael ducu.<verse eid="JDG 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Ka dok ludongo me lwak guwaco ni, “Wabitimo ningning pi nongo mon pi dano mudongi, ma dong kityeko mon ma ikin jo Benjamin woko ducuni?” <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Ci guwaco ni, “Luleyo myero gunonge pi jo Benjamin ma gubwot, wek kaka mo pe kijwa woko ki Icrael. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Ento pe watwero miyo anyirawa botgi me bedo mon gi.” Pien yam jo Icrael gukwongo kwong ni, “Kicen ngat ma omiyo dako mo bot jo Benjamin.” <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Pimeno guwaco ni, “Nen, tye nino madit me woro Rwot ma bedo mwaka ki mwaka i Cilo, matye tung kumalo me Betel, i kunyango me gudu ma a ki i Betel cito Cekem, i kupiny me Lebona.” <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Ci guciko jo Benjamin ni, “Wucit wubut i poti me olok, wukur dano, <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />ci wukii. Kace anyira Cilo gibino kamyel, ci wubin, wumakgi woko, kun dano acel acel mako dakone ki ikin anyira Cilo, ci wucit kwedgi wa i lobo Benjamin. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Kace wegigi nyo omegigi gubino kalaro loke botwa, ci wabiwaco botgi ni, ‘Wutim ber omii ki gin anyira ni, pien yam pe wakelo anyira ki i mony ma romogi ducu, wun bene pe wumiyo anyirawu ikare ca botgi; kono wumiyogi botgi, kono wuroco.’” <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Ci jo Benjamin gutimo kitmeno; gutero mon gi ma oporo welgi, ma gumako ki ikin lumyel, ci gutingo yo, gucito, gudok mere wa i lobo mayam guleyoni, ka gugero taun gi odoco, gubedo iye. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Jo Icrael guket woko ki kenyo ikare meno; kun ngat acel acel odok i kakane ki i dogolane, kun dano acel acel cito i lobo mayam oleyo.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 17:6">Lung 17:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ikare meno onongo dano mo ma laloyo maber peke i Icrael; ci omiyo dano acel acel tiyo gin ma en tamo ni tye atir ki i cwinye.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>